omething?',12,7,100,3,0,0,0,32811,0,'Wilhelm Strang to Player'),(1360,0,0,'I\'ll take whatever ya got cookin\'! And throw in a bottle to wash it down!',12,6,0,0,0,0,0,124,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1364,0,0,'This land belongs to the Dark Iron Dwarves.  Prepare to see the afterlife, $C!',12,6,0,0,0,0,0,455,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,0,0,'Nuh uh.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,136,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,0,1,'Liar!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,138,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,0,2,'Shhh! You\'re scaring the fish away.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,143,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,0,3,'Maybe we should go to the bridge and fish.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,146,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,1,0,'You\'re making that up.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,144,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,1,1,'If you could catch a fish big enough for your mouth we\'d never be hungry again.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,145,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1366,1,2,'Really?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,147,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,0,0,'Think there are any fish in here?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,131,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,0,1,'I caught a big one last week, it had three eyes!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,132,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,0,2,'My daddy says that in the ocean, there are fish so big they could swallow a whole ship.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,133,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,0,3,'My daddy can catch more fish than your daddy!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,134,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,1,0,'Look! Look! I caught something! Aww....it\'s just a stinky ol\' boot.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,135,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,1,1,'I heard that there are these huge fish that can walk on land to hunt, and eat people!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,139,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,1,2,'And one time, at camp, I caught a fish that was bigger than I am!!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,140,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1367,1,3,'I heard a story about this golden fish, and if you caught it you would get three wishes!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,141,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,0,0,'Hey guys, let\'s try on the other side.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1090,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,1,0,'Really?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,147,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,1,1,'Wow.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,157,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,1,2,'Oh yeah, I heard about that.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,158,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,1,3,'Oh c\'mon, that\'s not true.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,166,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,2,0,'That\'s neat.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,167,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,2,1,'My father says that\'s just a story.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,168,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,2,2,'Can you imagine?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,169,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,2,3,'Sounds kinda like one of Billy\'s fish stories to me.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,170,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,3,0,'I thought I heard something.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,171,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,3,1,'I think I see something.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,172,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,3,2,'Eww... that\'s not a fish!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,173,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,3,3,'I got worm guts on my shoes.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,174,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,4,0,'Something smells funny.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,175,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,4,1,'I hope that was a fish!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,176,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,4,2,'I don\'t think there\'s any fish in these canals.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,177,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,5,0,'And that\'s how Lothar killed thirty six orcs with his bare hands!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,149,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,5,1,'And so the knights stood before the charging Horde and held their ground as a thousand berserk orcs came through the valley.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,150,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,5,2,'They say he can turn into a raven sometimes.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,151,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,5,3,'You know why orc eyes glow red? It\'s because they drink blood!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,152,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,6,0,'There is no spoon.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,153,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,6,1,'I swear, people have actually seen them. Pandaren really do exist!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,154,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,6,2,'And then the rabbit just bit his head off... I swear.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,155,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1368,6,3,'You know there are crocilisks in the Canals. They were brought from the swamp as pets, but got thrown in the canals.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,156,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1373,0,0,'%s gestures to the pitcher of water sitting on the edge of the well.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,1528,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,1,0,'Hey there, Belm!  Give me a mug of Thunder Ale, and one for my good friend $n.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,125,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,2,0,'How goes the barrel watching...?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,126,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,3,0,'Well, back to business for me.  But it sure was nice taking that short break, and it\'s always nice drinking Thunder Ale!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,128,0,'Jarven Thunderbrew'),(1373,4,0,'Hey there, Belm!  Give me a mug of Thunder Ale, and one for my good friend $n.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,125,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1377,0,0,'Ah yes. I\'ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,233,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,1,0,'Bah! By the time you got in range of old Trollplow you would be in reduced to rubble!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,235,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,2,0,'Hey Fizzer, I ever tell you the time I was riding through the canals and some goblins in shredder suits tried to ambush me?',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,237,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,3,0,'Brahaha! Tha look on their faces as old Trollplow\'s gun came swiveling around to meet them! Their saws couldn\'t even touch me!',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,239,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,4,0,'Bah! That\'s no fun!',12,7,100,274,0,0,0,241,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,5,0,'Aye sure, just as long as we get to hit the arena right after!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,244,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,6,0,'Har! You scared I\'ll hurt your little dainty racer?',12,7,100,6,0,0,0,246,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,7,0,'Haha! Sturdy old Trollplow has just a few meager battle scars!',12,7,100,11,0,0,0,248,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,8,0,'Ha! I\'d take the sound of a Crater Cannon XT blasting off a shell over that any day!',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,250,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,9,0,'Maybe, but if it did hit me upside the head I\'d know exactly which cannon to use to blow it into the smallest bits!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,252,0,'Pilot Stonegear'),(1377,10,0,'Ah yes. I\'ve heard all about those new flarged things. Armor was removed from the casing to decrease weight. Bargh! Nonsense!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,233,0,'VMaNGOS')