ift slightly, at this point if you cast a binding cantrip you will solidify it in place.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,204,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1413,0,3,'When the positively aligned energies collide with the negatively charged energies, they don\'t negate one another.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,205,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1413,1,0,'Wow, all of this for a love potion. Hope he\'s worth it.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,222,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1413,1,1,'If we use the Surian theory, then yes, but not if we go with the Y\'serian approach.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,223,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1413,1,2,'At least we wouldn\'t be around to have to clean it up.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,224,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1413,1,3,'Only if we didn\'t follow the proper initialization procedures.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,225,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,0,0,'But what if the resulting frequency shift were to send magical feedback up the flows?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,210,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,0,1,'Wouldn\'t that cause the weave to unravel if not properly anchored before starting the casting?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,211,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,0,2,'But wouldn\'t that mean crossing the streams? Isn\'t that really bad?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,212,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,0,3,'The resultant energies could collapse though, and that could cause an energy flux that would give you a migraine for weeks.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,213,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,1,0,'Maginor says that twisting alternating flows of positive energy actually creates a much more stable flow.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,206,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,1,1,'The magical wards at that point should be supported enough by the energy flux to contain the entity.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,207,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,1,2,'Why can\'t we just shift the array to compensate for the variance in the flux?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,208,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1414,1,3,'Putting in twelve centers of focus might allow the magical energies to form more solidly, adding the necessary stability.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,209,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,0,0,'What if we used three focuses in Tyrean pattern? That should solve it.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,218,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,0,1,'But if we stabilize it with an anchor thread at the appropriate energy crux then it should work.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,219,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,0,2,'Always so negative. The chances of that happening are between zero and none.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,220,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,0,3,'If we use the appropriate sequence we should be ok. Will just take some serious studying before we start.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,221,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,1,0,'But isn\'t that what caused the initial problems with Adept Syleria\'s magical formulae?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,214,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,1,1,'I think not, I don\'t need to be blown up again.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,215,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,1,2,'That will unbalance the magical focus, though, and cause a reverse vibration in the ether.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,216,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1415,1,3,'I suppose that could work, if we had twenty people to cast it with.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,217,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,0,0,'Follow me, good Paladin.  I\'ll have your barding done faster than I could down a Dwarven stout.  Mmmm... stout.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,9776,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,1,0,'Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,9779,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,2,0,'%s begins to work...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2346,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,3,0,'Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor.',12,7,100,5,0,0,0,2347,0,'Grimand Elmore'),(1416,4,0,'%s begins to work...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,2346,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,5,0,'Amazing!  It worked!  $n, I have your armor.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,2347,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,6,0,'Follow me, good Paladin.  I\'ll have your barding done faster than I could down a Dwarven stout.  Mmmm... stout.',12,7,0,1,0,0,0,9776,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,7,0,'%s assembles the runecloth, herbs, and holy water to the barding.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,9777,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,8,0,'%s smiths the arcanite into place on the barding.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,9778,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1416,9,0,'Well, that should do it.  Come now, back to the shop to finish our business!',12,7,0,1,0,0,0,9779,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1421,0,0,'Curse you, $n!  One day, vengeance will be mine!',14,7,0,14,0,0,0,229,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1423,0,0,'Hello again, Antonio. Thank you again for the hat for my wife. She adored it.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,718,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1426,0,0,'More bones to gnaw on...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1871,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1426,0,1,'Grrrr... fresh meat!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1870,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1427,0,0,'Ah, much appreciated, Corbett.  We\'ll get these on the racks immediately.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,261,0,'Harlan Bagley'),(1427,0,1,'Ah yes, and promptly delivered.  As always, it\'s a pleasure doing business with you, Corbett.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,262,0,'Harlan Bagley'),(1428,0,0,'Corbett, dear.  Harlan needs a load of knitted shirts and pants as soon as we can manage.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,253,0,'Rema Schneider'),(1428,0,1,'Corbett, you there?  Harlan needs another load of knitted goods.  Can you take it to him?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,254,0,'Rema Schneider'),(1428,1,0,'Corbett, you there?  Harlan needs another load of knitted goods.  Can you take it to him?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,254,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1428,1,1,'Corbett, dear.  Harlan needs a load of knitted shirts and pants as soon as we can manage.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,253,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,0,0,'Scourge spotted nearby!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12366,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,0,1,'I just saw a Scourge!  Kill it!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12367,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,0,2,'Did you see that?  There\'s a Scourge over there!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12368,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,0,3,'How can I get anything done with the Scourge running amok around here?!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12369,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,1,0,'There\'s one of the Scourge, right over there!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12370,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,1,1,'This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12371,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,1,2,'Will these unrelenting Scourge attacks never end?',12,7,0,6,0,0,0,12372,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1432,1,3,'Destroy the Scourge invader now, before it\'s too late!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12373,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1433,0,0,'My pleasure, sugar drop.  I\'ll be back soon...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,255,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,0,1,'Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I\'ll get him resupplied right away!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,256,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,1,0,'Hm...after dropping this off, I think I\'ll head to that cheese shop for a snack.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,257,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,1,1,'I should have a few extra coins from this sale.  Maybe I\'ll buy myself some lunch...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,258,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,2,0,'Hey, Harlan.  Here\'s a load of knitted cloth for you.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,259,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,2,1,'Oomph!  Here\'s another load of supplies, Harlan.  It must be selling fast!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,260,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,3,0,'Well, I\'m off then.  Take care, Harlan.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,263,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,3,1,'Glad to see you\'re doing so well, Harlan.  And I hope to see you again soon...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,264,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,4,0,'Now for that snack...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,283,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,5,0,'Good day, Elling!  Hullo Elaine!  Let me have a wheel of bleu cheese, eh?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,284,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,5,1,'Hullo, Trias clan!  A ball of your smoked mozzarella, if you please!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,285,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,6,0,'Yes ma\'am, business is brisk!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,295,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,7,0,'Thank you kindly!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,290,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,7,1,'Thanks for the cheese!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,291,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,8,0,'I should get back before Rema starts to worry...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,292,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,8,1,'Time to get back to the shop...',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,293,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,9,0,'I\'m back!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,294,0,'Corbett Schneider'),(1433,10,0,'My pleasure, sugar drop.  I\'ll be back soon...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,255,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1433,10,1,'Business must be good down at the bazaar.  I\'ll get him resupplied right away!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,256,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1439,0,0,'M