Don\'t remember a damn thing.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,410,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,3,3,'Wasn\'t that the night we had to pick up my thumb and carry it in your smoke pouch?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,411,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,4,0,'I have a piece of iron in my back that will remind me of that night for the rest of my days.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,413,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,4,1,'Course I remember that night. Two inches to the left and you\'d be drinking with that elf, Morris. That was my best shirt, too.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,414,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,4,2,'Was that the third or fourth time you nearly got me gutted trying one of your crazy stunts?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,415,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,4,3,'Aye and thanks for letting me carry my own hand back to the priests that night.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,416,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,5,0,'Hehe, wimp.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,417,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,5,1,'You screamed like a little girl, funniest thing I ever saw.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,418,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,5,2,'It all worked out in the end.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,419,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,5,3,'Let\'s not even begin comparing battle scars, my friend.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,420,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,6,0,'Never seen anyone move so fast in my whole life.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,421,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,6,1,'You are constantly surprising me with what a person can live through.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,422,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,6,2,'Well, you\'re still here. I\'d say that is something worth drinking to.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,423,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1478,6,3,'You can thank me anytime for making your life more interesting.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,424,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1482,0,0,'You get down from there right now!  I don\'t want you climbing that thing.  It\'s not safe.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,307,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1482,1,0,'I can\'t come down.  I am scared.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,304,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1482,2,0,'Whoa...Whoa..Aaaaahhh!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,305,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1482,3,0,'See what I mean?  Get inside right now.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,308,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1484,0,0,'Gimlok!  Gimlok! Get in here this instant!',12,6,0,0,0,0,0,394,0,'VMaNGOS'),(1484,0,1,'Where has t