fore the stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,848,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - EMOTE_PROGRESS_4'),(2768,4,0,'Help!!! Get these things off me so I can get my work done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,859,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_AGGRO'),(2768,4,1,'Help!! I told you this place was cursed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,858,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe'),(2768,5,0,'Almost done! Just a little longer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,849,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_PROGRESS_5'),(2768,6,0,'I\'ve done it! I have harnessed the power of the stone into the goggles! Let\'s get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,850,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_PROGRESS_6'),(2768,7,0,'Phew! Glad to be back from that creepy cave.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,851,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_PROGRESS_7'),(2768,8,0,'%s hands the glowing goggles over to Doctor Draxlegauge.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,889,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - EMOTE_PROGRESS_8'),(2768,9,0,'Doctor Draxlegauge will give you further instructions, $n. Many thanks for your help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,890,0,'Professor Phizzlethorpe - SAY_PROGRESS_9'),(2775,0,0,'Nothing will stop us! You will die!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,855,0,'Daggerspine Marauder'),(2775,0,1,'You\'ve plundered our treasures too long.  Prepare to meet your watery grave!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,854,0,'Daggerspine Marauder'),(2784,0,0,'%s carefully studies Sara Balloo\'s note and lets out a long, solemn sigh.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,860,0,'VMaNGOS'),(2784,1,0,'Let it be known that $n - Alliance $C - has earned the undying respect of Ironforge and the Alliance as a whole.  $GHe : She; has engaged in great diplomacy with Timbermaw Hold and performed valiant actions for them on our behalf.   $GHe : She; has gone above and beyond the call of duty.  Three cheers for $n - a true hero of the Alliance!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,11308,0,'VMaNGOS'),(2785,0,0,'Those thieving elementals are up the path, this way.  Good luck, $n.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,3004,0,'VMaNGOS'),(2785,1,0,'%s begins searching through his pack...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,870,0,'VMaNGOS'),(2785,2,0,'Ah!  There is 