8,10,3,'This $n is a minion from Naralex\'s nightmare no doubt!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1276,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3678,10,4,'Help!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1277,0,'Disciple of Naralex SAY_AGGRO'),(3679,0,0,'%s tosses fitfully in troubled sleep.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1268,0,'Naralex EMOTE_AWAKENING_1'),(3679,1,0,'%s writhes in agony. The Disciple seems to be breaking through.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1269,0,'Naralex EMOTE_AWAKENING_2'),(3679,2,0,'%s dreams up a horrendous vision. Something stirs beneath the murky waters.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,1270,0,'Naralex EMOTE_AWAKENING_3'),(3679,3,0,'I AM AWAKE, AT LAST!',14,0,100,15,0,5789,0,1271,0,'Naralex SAY_AWAKENING_4'),(3679,4,0,'Ah, to be pulled from the dreaded nightmare! I thank you, my loyal Disciple, along with your brave companions.',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,1272,0,'Naralex SAY_AWAKENING_5'),(3679,5,0,'We must go and gather with the other Disciples. There is much work to be done before I can make another attempt to restore the Barrens. Farewell, brave souls!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,2103,0,'Naralex SAY_AWAKENING_6'),(3692,0,0,'Alright, let\'s go.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,5227,0,'Volcor'),(3692,1,0,'Oh no!  Here they come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,3744,0,'Volcor'),(3692,2,0,'Thank you again, $n. I\'ll make my way to the road now. When you can, find Terenthis and let him know we escaped.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1236,0,'Volcor'),(3692,3,0,'We made it, my friend. Remember to find Terenthis and let him know we\'re safe. Thank you again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1243,0,'Volcor'),(3692,4,0,'Here they come!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1250,0,'Volcor'),(3692,4,1,'We can overcome these foul creatures!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1251,0,'Volcor'),(3692,4,2,'We shall earn our deaths at the very least!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1252,0,'Volcor'),(3692,4,3,'Don\'t give up! Fight to the death!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1253,0,'Volcor'),(3693,0,0,'What is happening?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,13848,0,'Terenthis'),(3693,1,0,'Grimclaw?! Easy there, my friend... where is your master Volcor?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1227,0,'Terenthis'),(3693,2,0