,7,0,0,0,0,0,1308,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3848,0,0,'%s protects himself with magic.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1342,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3848,1,0,'Uh... the disease is potent.  And it attacks the mind...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1316,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3848,2,0,'I must... RESIST!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1318,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3848,3,0,'I have survived the poisons of the Forsaken, $n, and I know now what must be done.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1319,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,0,0,'Free from this wretched cell at last! Let me show you to the courtyard....',12,1,0,4,0,0,0,1320,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,1,0,'About time someone killed the wretch.',12,1,0,1,0,0,0,1328,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,2,0,'You are indeed courageous for wanting to brave the horrors that lie beyond this door.',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,1321,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,3,0,'%s fumbles with the rusty lock on the courtyard door.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1322,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,4,0,'There we go!',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,1323,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3849,5,0,'Good luck with Arugal. I must hurry back to Hadrec now.',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,1324,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3850,0,0,'Follow me and I\'ll open the courtyard door for you.',12,7,0,1,0,0,0,1331,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3850,1,0,'For once I agree with you... scum.',12,7,0,1,0,0,0,1329,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3850,2,0,'I have just the spell to get this door open. Too bad the cell doors weren\'t locked so haphazardly.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1332,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3850,3,0,'There it is! Wide open. Good luck to you conquering what lies beyond. I must report back to the Kirin Tor at once!',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1334,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3850,4,0,'%s vanishes.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1343,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3888,0,0,'%s stretches and lets loose with a large yawn.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,1296,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3892,0,0,'%s drinks the cure brought by $n.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1336,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3892,1,0,'Uh... Father...?  Are you there?  I\'m hungry... can I have some stew?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1337,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3892,2,0,'%s stirs from her delirium.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1441,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3892,3,0,'Mmmmh...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1442,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3892,4,0,'Mmh... my eyes are not so heavy now, father.  Can we go out and play?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1349,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3893,0,0,'A paladin! Slaying him would please the master. Attack!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,1309,0,'Forsaken Scout'),(3894,0,0,'Here you are, Relara.  Take this...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1335,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,1,0,'What?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1338,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,2,0,'You\'re awake??  Your cure must have worked!  Thank you, $n.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1339,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,3,0,'%s crushes the tear into a bowl of stew.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1438,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,4,0,'Eat this, my daughter.  It will help you feel better.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1439,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,5,0,'There you go...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1440,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,6,0,'%s places a poultice on Relara\'s brow.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1443,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,7,0,'%s breathes a sigh of relief.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1444,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,8,0,'%s crushes the moonstone into a cup of tea.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1346,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,9,0,'Here you are, Relara.  Drink this...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1347,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,10,0,'Relara... you\'re awake?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1350,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,11,0,'Rest now, my daughter.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1351,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3894,12,0,'%s looks at $n, and then weeps with joy.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1352,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3916,0,0,'The rod\'s design is simple. Dartol didn\'t use his arcane knowledge in its creation... it is more druidic in nature.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1380,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3916,1,0,'Hehe... I made a pun, didn\'t I? Druidic in nature... I\'m so funny.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1381,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3916,2,0,'Now, then... the rod. Let\'s see about fixing it, shall we?',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1382,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3916,3,0,'There! Now it just needs to be recharged...',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,1383,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3925,0,0,'%s goes into a rage after seeing a friend fall in battle!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1151,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3927,0,0,'I can\'t believe it! You\'ve destroyed my pack... Now face my wrath!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,2086,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3932,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3946,0,0,'The numbers of my companions dwindles, goddess, and my own power shall soon be insufficient to hold back the demons of Felwood.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1356,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,1,0,'Goddess, grant me the power to overcome my enemies! Hear me, please, my need is desperate and my cause is just!',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1357,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,2,0,'What... what is this? Could this be the answer to my prayers? Elune has granted me a weapon--this scythe--to defeat the demons.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,1358,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,3,0,'I have failed... I have failed in my duty... failed my people... The worgen run rampant, and the Scythe of my goddess is lost.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1359,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3946,4,0,'This evil I have unleashed... In whose hand does the power my goddess granted to me now lie... By whose hand is it directed?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,1360,0,'Velinde Starsong'),(3974,0,0,'Release the hounds!',14,0,100,0,0,5841,0,20395,0,'loksey SAY_AGGRO'),(3975,0,0,'Ah - I\'ve been waiting for a real challenge!',14,0,100,0,0,5830,0,6194,0,'herod SAY_AGGRO'),(3975,1,0,'Blades of light!',14,0,100,0,0,5832,0,6534,0,'herod SAY_WHIRLWIND'),(3975,2,0,'Light, give me strength!',14,0,100,0,0,5833,0,6195,0,'herod SAY_ENRAGE'),(3975,3,0,'Is that all?',14,0,100,0,0,5831,0,6196,0,'herod SAY_KILL'),(3975,4,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'herod EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(3976,0,0,'Infidels! They must be purified!',14,0,100,0,0,5835,0,2847,0,'mograine SAY_MO_AGGRO'),(3976,1,0,'Unworthy.',14,0,100,0,0,5836,0,6197,0,'mograine SAY_MO_KILL'),(3976,2,0,'At your side, milady!',14,0,100,0,0,5837,0,18026,0,'mograine SAY_MO_RESSURECTED'),(3976,3,0,'Infidels! They must be purified!',12,0,0,0,0,5835,0,2847,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3976,4,0,'Arise, my champion!',12,0,0,0,0,5840,0,6532,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3976,5,0,'At your side, milady!',12,0,0,0,0,5837,0,6533,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3976,6,0,'Unworthy.',12,0,0,0,0,5836,0,6197,0,'VMaNGOS'),(3977,0,0,'Mograine has fallen! You shall pay for this treachery! Arise, my champion! Arise!'