lease visit...zzzzttt!!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,2438,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6235,0,0,'Electric justice!',12,0,0,0,0,5811,0,6177,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6236,0,0,'Hail $n!  New Champion of The Affray!',12,0,0,22,0,0,0,2354,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6238,0,0,'Ready when you are, warrior.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,2421,0,'big will SAY_BIG_WILL_READY'),(6244,0,0,'A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2310,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,1,0,'Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2311,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,2,0,'But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera\'s armor was pierced by a demon\'s tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2312,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,3,0,'Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and quickly laid him low.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2314,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,4,0,'Where the two lovers fell, a tree would bloom. The elves call it the heartswood. It will surely serve your ends.',12,7,100,1,0,0,0,2317,0,'Takar the Seer'),(6244,5,0,'A thousand years ago, the immortal elves, demigods of the forest and dragons fought against the Legion on the slopes of Hyjal.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,2310,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6244,6,0,'Anathera and Latherion fought back to back where the battle was thickest. Two lovers determined to survive the war together.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,2311,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6244,7,0,'But it was not to be. As their foes pressed close, Anathera\'s armor was pierced by a demon\'s tainted blade. In the thick of battle, there would be nothing to save her.',12,7,0,0,0,0,0,2312,0,'VMaNGOS'),(6244,8,0,'Ignoring the battle that raged about him, Latherion dropped his guard to cradle his love in her dying moments. But the demons gave him no quarter, and