s pitifully.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,5459,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10117,1,0,'%s begs to be put out of his misery.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,5460,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10117,1,1,'%s groans.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,4726,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10117,1,2,'%s weeps pitifully.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,5459,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10160,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10162,0,0,'Excellent... it would appear as if the meddlesome insects have arrived just in time to feed my legion. Welcome, mortals!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5635,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,1,0,'Let not even a drop of their blood remain upon the arena floor, my children. Feast on their souls!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5640,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,2,0,'Foolsss... Kill the one in the dress!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5665,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,3,0,'Inconceivable!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5666,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,4,0,'Your efforts will prove fruitless. None shall stand in our way!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5668,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,5,0,'Do not force my hand, children! I shall use your hides to line my boots.',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5667,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,6,0,'Use the freezing breath, imbecile!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5664,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,7,0,'THIS CANNOT BE!!! Rend, deal with these insects.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5709,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,8,0,'The Warchief shall make quick work of you, mortals. Prepare yourselves!',14,0,100,25,0,0,0,5720,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,9,0,'Taste in my power!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5726,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,10,0,'Your victory shall be short lived. The days of both the Alliance and Horde are coming to an end! The next time we meet shall be the last.',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,5824,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,11,0,'The mortals have fallen! The new age of the Blackrock legion is at hand!',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,5710,0,'Lord Victor Nefarius (UBRS)'),(10162,12,0,'In this world where time is your enemy, it is