ds carved into the stone, and you must find a way to light it.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7386,0,'Ranshalla SAY_REACH_ALTAR_2'),(10300,6,0,'The altar is glowing! We have done it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7412,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_1'),(10300,7,0,'What is happening? Look!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7388,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_2'),(10300,10,0,'Please, priestesses, forgive us for our intrusion. We do not wish any harm here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7391,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_5'),(10300,11,0,'We only wish to know why the wildkin guard this area...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7392,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_ALTAR_6'),(10300,27,0,'Thank you for your help, $n. I wish you well in your adventures. ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7434,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_END_1'),(10300,28,0,'I want to stay here and reflect on what we have seen. Please see Erelas and tell him what we have learned.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,7435,0,'Ranshalla SAY_RANSHALLA_END_2'),(10300,29,0,'%s begins chanting a strange spell...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7467,0,'Ranshalla EMOTE_CHANT_SPELL'),(10304,0,0,'Please wait while I attempt to bind the shards together so that they will be whole once again.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,8332,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10304,1,0,'Ishnu... Oshalan thara dormil... Anu\'dorin...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,8333,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10304,2,0,'Yes, I was able to reseal the relic, $n.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,8338,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10321,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'Emberstrife'),(10339,0,0,'Taste in my power!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,5726,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10339,1,0,'%s is knocked off his drake!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,5711,0,'VMaNGOS'),(10340,0,0,'You have come too far to fail. Stand back, mortals.',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,5760,0,'VMaNGOS dbscript'),(10340,1,0,'You will suffer in this defeat, Nefarian!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,5761,0,'VMaNGOS dbscript'),(10340,2,0,'All is not lost! Battle these beasts without fear. Your wounds I shall heal, bones I shall mend. Be renewed, heroes!',14,0,100,1,0,0,0,5748,0,'VMaNGOS dbscript'),(10373,0,0,'What the... nobody cleanses a furbolg 