'%s senses your presence and opens a nether portal!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,9489,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14392,0,0,'People of the Horde, citizens of Orgrimmar, come, gather round and celebrate a hero of the Horde. On this day, $n, under the auspices of our glorious Warchief, laid a mortal blow against the Black Dragonflight. The brood mother, Onyxia, has been slain!',14,1,0,0,0,0,0,9491,2,'VMaNGOS'),(14392,1,0,'Bear witness to the undeniable power of your Warchief! Be lifted by the rallying cry of your dragon slayers!',14,1,0,0,0,0,0,9492,2,'VMaNGOS'),(14394,0,0,'Citizens and allies of Stormwind, on this day, history has been made. $n has laid waste to that which had attempted to usurp the rule of the kingdom. Gather round and join me in honoring our heroes.',14,7,0,0,0,0,0,9495,2,'VMaNGOS'),(14394,1,0,'Behold the might of the Alliance! The dread lady, Onyxia, hangs from the arches! Let the rallying cry of the dragon slayer lift your spirits!',14,7,0,0,0,0,0,9496,2,'VMaNGOS'),(14435,0,0,'Well done, servant. For so long I have been held captive within the prison of the Firelord. I am once more free to feast upon the out world! The land shall once more be ravaged by the force of the Wind Seeker!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9570,0,'Prince Thunderaan'),(14435,1,0,'Ah, and the fool who freed me shall be among the first to quell my immense hunger.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9571,0,'Prince Thunderaan'),(14435,2,0,'My power is discombobulatingly devastating! It is ludicrous that these mortals even attempt to enter my realm!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,9572,0,'Prince Thunderaan'),(14459,0,0,'%s flee as the controlling power of the orb is drained.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,9592,0,'Nefarian\'s Troops '),(14469,0,0,'Stand back! Stand clear! The infernal will need to be given a wide berth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9634,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,1,0,'BOW DOWN TO THE ALMIGHTY! BOW DOWN BEFORE MY INFERNAL DESTRO... chicken?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,9635,0,'Niby the Almighty'),(14469,2,0,'Silence, servant! Vengeance will be mine! Death to Stormwi