tured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,3,0,'How pathetic. I am infused with the power of the Soulflayer. I fear nothing but the wrath of the almighty Hakkar. I serve no one but my master, Jin.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10316,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,4,0,'Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10318,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,5,0,'Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10319,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,6,0,'%s laughs maniacally.',16,0,100,11,0,0,0,10321,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,7,0,'FOOL! Do you purport to have even one-tenth of the power you held during the Uprising? The nations were united and still were nearly consumed by a shadow of Hakkar. You stand no chance.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10322,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,8,0,'And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10323,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,9,0,'Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10324,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,10,0,'The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10326,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,11,0,'It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol\'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul\'jin missing, probably dead.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10327,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,12,0,'And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10328,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,13,0,'%s smirks.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10329,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,14,0,'Is it? Call out to them, Servitor.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10331,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,15,0,'Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10333,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,16,0,'Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,10334,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,17,0,'%s drops his shoulders and exposes his neck.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10335,0,'Captured Hakkari Zealot'),(14912,18,0,'Curious. A Servitor of Rastakhan that does not know the Hakkari do not converse in the old tongue?',12,14,0,6,0,0,0,10310,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,19,0,'You are a fool, soon to forfeit his life. No?',12,14,0,6,0,0,0,10313,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,20,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,0,11,0,0,0,10315,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,21,0,'How pathetic. I am infused with the power of the Soulflayer. I fear nothing but the wrath of the almighty Hakkar. I serve no one but my master, Jin.',12,14,0,1,0,0,0,10316,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,22,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,0,11,0,0,0,10315,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,23,0,'Do you really need to ask? Can you not feel him? Has the almighty King Rastakhan sent his Servitor and Hand here on a mission of diplomacy?',12,14,0,1,0,0,0,10318,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,24,0,'Oh yes, old one, Hakkar has returned. Soon the world shall crumble beneath his might. Consumed. Left in ruin...',12,14,0,1,0,0,0,10319,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,25,0,'%s laughs maniacally.',16,0,0,11,0,0,0,10321,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,26,0,'FOOL! Do you purport to have even one-tenth of the power you held during the Uprising? The nations were united and still were nearly consumed by a shadow of Hakkar. You stand no chance.',12,14,0,25,0,0,0,10322,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,27,0,'And now, even those nations that you would have called allies have recoiled and joined forces with us... Yes, old one, do not look so surprised.',12,14,0,1,0,0,0,10323,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,28,0,'Bloodscalp, Sandfury, Skullsplitter, Vilebranch and Witherbark. They all pledge their allegiance to Jin - their souls to Hakkar. You have lost.',12,14,0,1,0,0,0,10324,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,29,0,'%s laughs.',16,0,0,11,0,0,0,10315,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,30,0,'The young races? The infants? Humans? Orcs? Dwarves? You expect to defeat the Hakkari? To destroy a GOD?',12,14,0,6,0,0,0,10326,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,31,0,'It shall NEVER happen. We are legion. We are united. Where are your heroes? Vol\'jin sits in sanctuary at the side of the young Warchief, unaware. Zul\'jin missing, probably dead.',12,14,0,5,0,0,0,10327,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,32,0,'%s smirks.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,10329,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,33,0,'And... do you expect to defeat the Primal Gods?',12,14,0,6,0,0,0,10328,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,34,0,'Is it? Call out to them, Servitor.',12,14,0,6,0,0,0,10331,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,35,0,'Where are your Gods now? WHERE, SERVITOR?',12,14,0,11,0,0,0,10333,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,36,0,'Strike me down. I shall be reborn... Even more powerful...',12,14,0,5,0,0,0,10334,0,'VMaNGOS'),(14912,37,0,'%s drops his shoulders and exposes his neck.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,10335,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15076,0,0,'The Blood God, the Soulflayer, has been defeated!  We are imperiled no longer!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10612,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15177,0,0,'Sentinels, come to my defense!',12,2,0,0,0,0,0,4562,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15178,0,0,'Guards!',12,1,0,0,0,0,0,4561,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15181,0,0,'Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn\'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11355,0,'Commander Mar\'alith'),(15181,1,0,'Soldiers of Kalimdor! Heroes of Silithus! One among you has dealt a vicious blow to our mortal enemies! $n and $g his:her; allies have relieved the Ruins of Ahn\'Qiraj of its merciless leader! Ossirian the Unscarred, scourge of Silithus, has finally been destroyed and his armies wholly dismantled!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11355,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,0,0,'You dare spill blood on neutral ground? OUT! OUT, I SAY!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10948,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,0,1,'We don\'t take kindly to miscreants, $r.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10949,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,0,2,'Taste blade, mongrel!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10950,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,0,3,'Please tell me that you didn\'t just do what I think you just did. Please tell me that I\'m not going to have to hurt you... ',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10951,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,1,0,'Get a rope!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10952,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,1,1,'As if we don\'t have enough problems, you go and create more!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10953,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,1,2,'Believe me when I tell you this: You\'re gonna wish you weren\'t born, sissy!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10954,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15184,1,3,'Your actions shame us all, $c. I hurt inside as I beat you senseless.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10955,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15189,0,0,'You were always the troublemaker in the family, Noggle.  Always!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10751,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15190,0,0,'Yes!  I\'m cured!  I\'m cure... whoa, got up too fast!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10675,0,'Noggle Ficklespragg'),(15190,1,0,'Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison\'s made me... a bit tired...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10676,0,'Noggle Ficklespragg'),(15190,2,0,'Wha... where am I?  So... weak..',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10672,0,'Noggle Ficklespragg'),(15190,3,0,'Thanks for finding my reagents!  *yawn*  That poison\'s made me... a bit tired...',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10676,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15192,0,0,'A terrible and costly mistake you have made. It is not my time, mortals.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10658,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15203,0,0,'Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10805,0,'Prince Skaldrenox - YELL_ROYAL_AGGRO'),(15204,0,0,'Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10805,0,'High Marshal Whirlaxis - YELL_ROYAL_AGGRO'),(15205,0,0,'Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10805,0,'Baron Kazum - YELL_ROYAL_AGGRO'),(15206,0,0,'Wha