lood!',14,0,100,0,0,8619,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SLAY2'),(15263,1,2,'The screams of the dying will fill the air. A symphony of terror is about to begin!',14,0,100,0,0,8620,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SLAY3'),(15263,2,0,'Prepare for the return of the ancient ones!',14,0,100,0,0,8618,0,0,0,'skeram SAY_SPLIT'),(15263,3,0,'You only delay the inevitable!',14,0,100,0,0,8622,0,11447,0,'skeram SAY_DEATH'),(15299,0,0,'%s begins to slow!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11343,0,'EMOTE_SLOW'),(15299,1,0,'%s is freezing up!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11345,0,'EMOTE_FREEZE'),(15299,2,0,'%s is frozen solid!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11695,0,'EMOTE_FROZEN'),(15299,3,0,'%s begins to crack!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11346,0,'EMOTE_CRACK'),(15299,4,0,'%s looks ready to shatter!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,11347,0,'EMOTE_SHATTER'),(15299,5,0,'%s explodes!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,28803,0,'EMOTE_EXPLODE'),(15305,0,0,'Your treachery only speeds your doom.  This world will fall to darkness!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10805,0,'Lord Skwol - YELL_ROYAL_AGGRO'),(15307,0,0,'The Abyssal Council does not tolerate deceit!  Feel our wrath, little $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10686,0,'Earthen Templar - SAY_TEMPLAR_AGGRO'),(15324,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15339,0,0,'I am rejuvinated!',14,0,100,0,0,8593,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_1'),(15339,0,1,'My powers are renewed!',14,0,100,0,0,8595,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_2'),(15339,0,2,'My powers return!',14,0,100,0,0,8596,0,0,0,'SAY_SUPREME_3'),(15339,1,0,'Protect the city at all costs!',14,0,100,0,0,8597,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_1'),(15339,1,1,'To your posts. Defend the city.',14,0,100,0,0,8600,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_2'),(15339,1,2,'Tresspassers will be terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,8601,0,0,0,'SAY_INTRO_3'),(15339,2,0,'Sands of the desert, rise and block out the sun!',14,0,100,0,0,8598,0,11449,0,'SAY_AGGRO'),(15339,3,0,'You are terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,8602,0,11450,0,'SAY_SLAY'),(15339,4,0,'I...have...failed. ',14,0,100,0,0,8594,0,11451,0,'SAY_DEATH'),(15339,5,0,'The walls have been breached!',14,0,100,0,0,8599,0,11720,3,'SAY_KURINAXX_DEATH'),(15340,0,0,'%s senses your fear.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11441,0,'moam EMOTE_AGGRO'),(15340,1,0,'%s bristles with energy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12781,0,'moan EMOTE_MANA_FULL'),(15340,2,0,'%s drains your mana and turns to stone.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11474,0,'moam EMOTE_ENERGIZE'),(15341,0,0,'Warriors, Captains, continue the fight! ',12,0,0,0,0,8640,0,11434,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15341,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15341,2,0,'Breathe your last!',12,0,0,0,0,8639,0,11433,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15341,3,0,'Soon you will know the price of your meddling, mortals... The master is nearly whole... And when he rises, your world will cease.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11429,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15341,4,0,'Run if you want cowards!  It will do you no good!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11660,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15348,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'Kurinnaxx EMOTE_FRENZY'),(15368,0,0,'%s will be armed in 3 seconds!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10894,0,'Tonk Mine'),(15368,1,0,'%s is now armed!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,3543,0,'Tonk Mine'),(15369,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'Ayamiss frenzy'),(15370,0,0,'%s sets eyes on $n!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11074,0,'buru EMOTE_TARGET'),(15378,0,0,'There is a way...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10911,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_SAY_1'),(15378,1,0,'We will push them back, Anachronos. This I vow. Uphold your end of this task. Let not your hands falter as you seal our fates behind the barrier.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10908,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_SAY_2'),(15378,2,0,'Succumb to the endless dream, little ones. Let it consume you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10903,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_YELL_1'),(15378,3,0,'%s glances at her compatriots.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10912,0,'anachronos the ancient MERITHRA_EMOTE_1'),(15379,0,0,'Aye, Fandral, remember these words: Let not your grief guide your faith. These thoughts you hold... dark places you go, night elf. Absolution cannot be had through misguided vengeance.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10914,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_SAY_1'),(15379,1,0,'Do not forget the sacrifices made on this day, night elf. We have all suffered immensely at the hands of these beasts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10907,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_SAY_2'),(15379,2,0,'Alexstrasza grant me the resolve to drive our enemies back!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10902,0,'anachronos the ancient CAELESTRASZ_YELL_1'),(15380,0,0,'Anachronos, this diversion will give you and the young druid time enough to seal the gate. Do not falter. Now, let us see how they deal with chaotic magic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10904,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_SAY_1'),(15380,1,0,'Let them feel the wrath of the Blue Flight! May Malygos protect me!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,10901,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_YELL_1'),(15380,2,0,'%s nods knowingly.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10913,0,'anachronos the ancient ARYGOS_EMOTE_1'),(15381,0,0,'We must act quickly or all shall be lost!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10909,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_1'),(15381,1,0,'NOW, STAGHELM! WE GO NOW! Prepare your magic!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10915,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_2'),(15381,2,0,'Stay close...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10917,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_3'),(15381,3,0,'The sands of time will halt, but only for a moment! I will now conjure the barrier.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10930,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_4'),(15381,4,0,'FINISH THE SPELL, STAGHELM! I CANNOT HOLD THE GLYPHS OF WARDING IN PLACE MUCH LONGER! CALL FORTH THE ROOTS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10920,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_5'),(15381,5,0,'It... It is over, Lord Staghelm. We are victorious. Albeit the cost for this victory was great.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10923,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_6'),(15381,6,0,'There is but one duty that remains...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10924,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_7'),(15381,7,0,'Before I leave this place, I make one final offering to you, Lord Staghelm. Should a time arise in which you must gain entry to this accursed fortress, use the Scepter of the Shifting Sands on the sacred gong. The magic holding the barrier together will dissipate and the horrors of Ahn\'Qiraj will be unleashed upon the world once more.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10925,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_8'),(15381,8,0,'Lord Staghelm, where are you going? You would shatter our bond for the sake of pride?\n',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10931,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_9'),(15381,9,0,'And now you know all that there is to know, mortal... ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10935,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_SAY_10'),(15381,10,0,'%s hands the Scepter of the Shifting Sands to Fandral Staghelm.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10926,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_1'),(15381,11,0,'%s shakes his head in disappointment.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10933,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_2'),(15381,12,0,'%s kneels down to pick up the fragments of the shattered scepter.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10934,0,'anachronos the ancient ANACHRONOS_EMOTE_3'),(15382,0,0,'My forces cannot overcome the Qiraji defenses. We will not be able to get close enough to place your precious barrier, dragon.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10910,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_1'),(15382,1,0,'It is done, dragon. Lead the way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10916,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_2'),(15382,2,0,'Ancient ones guide my hand... Wake from your slumber! WAKE AND SEAL THIS CURSED PLACE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10921,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_3'),(15382,3,0,'After the savagery that my people have witnessed and felt, you expect me to accept another burden, dragon? Surely you are mad.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10927,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_4'),(15382,4,0,'I want nothing to do with Silithus, the Qiraji and least of all, any damned dragons!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10928,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_5'),(15382,5,0,'My son\'s soul will find no comfort in this hollow victory, dragon. I will have him back. Though it takes a millennia, I WILL have my son back!  ',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,10932,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_SAY_6'),(15382,6,0,'%s falls to one knee - exhausted.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10922,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_EMOTE_1'),(15382,7,0,'%s hurls the Scepter of the Shifting Sands into the barrier, shattering it.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10929,0,'anachronos the ancient FANDRAL_EMOTE_2'),(15384,0,0,'A Guardian of Icecrown enters the fight!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32804,0,'OLDWorld Trigger (DO NOT DELETE)'),(15387,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,1191,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15471,0,0,'Remember, Rajaxx, when I said I\'d kill you last?',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,11028,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15471,1,0,'I lied...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11477,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15471,2,0,'They come now. Try not to get yourself killed, young blood.',14,0,100,22,0,0,0,11012,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15471,3,0,'Come get some!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,11478,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15471,4,0,'Kill first, ask questions later... Incoming!',14,0,100,45,0,0,0,11032,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15471,5,0,'My work here is done. I\'ll be sure to let Mar\'alith and the others at Cenarion Hold know that you helped me out a little. Be careful in here, you don\'t have me holdin\' your hand past this point.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11560,0,'Lieutenant General Andorov'),(15481,0,0,'I SAID GOOD DAY!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,11060,0,'Spirit of Azuregos'),(15491,0,0,'Pitiful, predictable mortals... You know not what you have done! The Master\'s will fulfilled. The Moonglade shall be destroyed and Malfurion along with it!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11030,0,'Eranikus Say 0'),(15491,1,1,'%s lets loose a sinister laugh.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11296,0,'Eranikus Say 1'),(15491,2,2,'You are certainly not your father, insect. Should it interest me, I would crush you with but a swipe of my claws. Turn Shan\'do Stormrage over to me and your pitiful life will be spared along with the lives of your people.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11294,0,'Eranikus Say 2'),(15491,3,3,'My redemption? You are bold, little one. My redemption comes by the will of my god.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11297,0,'Eranikus Say 3'),(15491,4,4,'%s roars furiously.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11298,0,'Eranikus Say 4'),(15491,5,5,'Rise, servants of the Nightmare! Rise and destroy this world! Let there be no survivors...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11299,0,'Eranikus Say 5'),(15491,6,6,'Where is your savior? How long can you hold out against my attacks?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11304,0,'Eranikus Say 6'),(15491,7,7,'Remulos, look how easy they fall before me? You can stop this, fool. Turn the druid over to me and it will all be over...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11306,0,'Eranikus Say 7'),(15491,8,8,'Defeated my minions? Then face me, mortals!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11305,0,'Eranikus Say 8'),(15491,9,9,'IT BURNS! THE PAIN... SEARING...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11314,0,'Eranikus Say 9'),(15491,10,10,'WHY? Why did this happen to ... to me? Where were you Tyrande? Where were you when I fell from the grace of Elune?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11315,0,'Eranikus Say 10'),(15491,11,11,'I... I feel... I feel the touch of Elune upon my being once more... She smiles upon me... Yes... I...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11316,0,'Eranikus Say 11'),(15491,12,12,'%s falls to one knee.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11319,0,'Eranikus Say 12'),(15509,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,7798,0,'huhuran EMOTE_ENRAGE'),(15509,1,0,'%s goes into a berserker rage!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,4428,0,'huhuran EMOTE_BERSERK'),(15516,0,0,'You will be judged for defiling these sacred grounds!  The laws of the Ancients will not be challenged!  Trespassers will be annihilated!\n',14,0,100,0,0,8646,0,11442,0,'sartura SAY_AGGRO'),(15516,1,0,'I sentence you to death!',14,0,100,0,0,8647,0,11443,0,'sartura SAY_SLAY'),(15516,2,0,'I serve to the last!',14,0,100,0,0,8648,0,11444,0,'sartura SAY_DEATH'),(15516,3,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'sartura EMOTE_FRENZY'),(15526,0,0,'Lovely song, isn\'t it?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11089,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15537,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Anubisath Warrior'),(15542,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,10645,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15554,0,0,'KILL!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11110,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15623,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(15625,0,0,'Come, $n. See what the Nightmare brings...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11271,0,'Twilight Corrupter'),(15625,1,0,'The Nightmare cannot be stopped!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11269,0,'Twilight Corrupter'),(15625,2,0,'%s squeezes the last bit of life out of $n and swallows their soul.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11270,0,'Twilight Corrupter'),(15648,0,0,'%s bursts, showering the area with arcane residue!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12780,0,'Manawraith'),(15656,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Angershade'),(15657,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Darkwraith'),(15688,0,0,'Your blood will anoint my circle!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15145,0,'terestian SAY_SLAY1'),(15688,0,1,'The great one will be pleased.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15146,0,'terestian SAY_SLAY2'),(15688,1,0,'My life is yours, oh great one...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15137,0,'terestian SAY_DEATH'),(15688,2,0,'Ah, you\'re just in time. The rituals are about to begin!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15141,0,'terestian SAY_AGGRO'),(15688,3,0,'Please accept this humble offering, oh great one...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15147,0,'terestian SAY_SACRIFICE1'),(15688,3,1,'Let this sacrifice serve as testament to my fealty.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15148,0,'terestian SAY_SACRIFICE2'),(15688,4,0,'Come, you dwellers in the dark! Rally to my call!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15150,0,'terestian SAY_SUMMON1'),(15688,4,1,'Gather, my pets... there is plenty for all!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,15151,0,'terestian SAY_SUMMON2'),(15692,0,0,'Ye\'ll be feasting on me blade this Winter Veil!  Yeargh!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11397,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,1,'No scallywag $c is taking our Winter Veil plunder!  Get \'em!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11398,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,2,'These land lubbers are here for the reindeer!  Give \'em the shank!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11399,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,3,'It\'s a rescue attempt!  Let no one escape!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11400,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,4,'Let me give you my regards for Greatfather Winter, scum...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11401,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,5,'Humbug!  Die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11402,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,6,'It\'s a rescue attempt!  Slay them all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11403,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15692,0,7,'The only thing Metzen is going to be doing this Winter Veil is roasting on a spit!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11404,0,'Dark Iron Kidnapper'),(15727,0,0,'%s is weakened!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,11476,0,'cthun EMOTE_WEAKENED'),(15746,8,0,'Presents for everyone! Father Winter\'s put gifts under the tree for all.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11430,0,'Great-father Winter\'s Helper'),(15766,0,0,'Scourge spotted nearby!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12366,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,0,1,'I just saw a Scourge!  Kill it!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12367,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,0,2,'Did you see that?  There\'s a Scourge over there!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12368,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,0,3,'How can I get anything done with the Scourge running amok around here?!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12369,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,1,0,'There\'s one of the Scourge, right over there!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12370,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,1,1,'This has gone too far.  How dare the Scourge attack Stormwind!  Destroy it before more come!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12371,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,1,2,'Will these unrelenting Scourge attacks never end?',12,7,0,6,0,0,0,12372,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15766,1,3,'Destroy the Scourge invader now, before it\'s too late!',12,7,0,5,0,0,0,12373,0,'VMaNGOS'),(15928,0,0,'You are too late!! I... must... obey!!',14,0,100,0,0,8872,0,13091,0,'thaddius SAY_GREET'),(15928,1,0,'Kill...',14,0,100,0,0,8867,0,13086,0,'thaddius SAY_AGGRO1'),(15928,1,1,'Eat... your... bones...',14,0,100,0,0,8868,0,13087,0,'thaddius SAY_AGGRO2'),(15928,1,2,'Break... you!!',14,0,100,0,0,8869,0,13088,0,'thaddius SAY_AGGRO3'),(15928,2,0,'You... die now!!',14,0,20,0,0,8877,0,13096,0,'thaddius SAY_SLAY'),(15928,3,0,'Now