uls.',14,0,100,0,0,8808,0,13028,3,'Gothik SAY_PHASE_TWO'),(16060,5,0,'I... am... undone.',14,0,100,0,0,8805,0,13026,3,'Gothik SAY_DEATH'),(16060,6,0,'Death is the only escape!',14,0,20,0,0,8806,0,13027,3,'Gothik SAY_KILL'),(16060,7,0,'%s teleports into the fray!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32306,3,'Gothik EMOTE_PHASE_TWO'),(16060,8,0,'The central gate opens!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,32307,3,'Gothik EMOTE_GATE_OPENED'),(16061,0,0,'Do as I taught you!',14,0,100,0,0,8855,0,13075,3,'Razuvious SAY_AGGRO #1'),(16061,0,1,'The time for practice is over! Show me what you have learned!',14,0,100,0,0,8859,0,13078,3,'Razuvious SAY_AGGRO #2'),(16061,0,2,'Show them no mercy!',14,0,100,0,0,8856,0,13076,3,'Razuvious SAY_AGGRO #3'),(16061,1,0,'%s lets loose a triumphant shout.',41,0,30,0,0,0,0,13082,3,'Razuvious SAY_SLAY'),(16061,2,0,'You should have stayed home.',14,0,50,0,0,8861,0,13081,3,'Razuvious SAY_TAUNTED #1'),(16061,2,1,'You disappoint me, students!',14,0,50,0,0,8858,0,13077,3,'Razuvious SAY_TAUNTED #2'),(16061,2,2,'I\'m just getting warmed up!',14,0,50,0,0,8852,0,13072,3,'Razuvious SAY_TAUNTED #3'),(16061,2,3,'Stand and fight!',14,0,50,0,0,8853,0,13073,3,'Razuvious SAY_TAUNTED #4'),(16061,2,4,'Sweep the leg... Do you have a problem with that?',14,0,50,0,0,8861,0,13080,3,'Razuvious SAY_TAUNTED #5'),(16061,3,0,'An honorable... death.',14,0,100,0,0,8860,0,13079,3,'Razuvious SAY_DEATH'),(16063,0,0,'Flee, before it\'s too late!',14,0,100,0,0,8913,0,13097,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_AGGRO'),(16063,1,2,'Do not continue! Turn back while there\'s still time!',14,0,100,0,0,8919,0,13103,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT3'),(16063,2,0,'I have no choice but to obey!',14,0,100,0,0,8916,0,13100,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_SPECIAL'),(16063,3,0,'Forgive me!',14,0,30,0,0,8915,0,13099,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_SLAY'),(16063,4,0,'It is... as it should be. ',14,0,100,0,0,8914,0,13098,0,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_DEATH'),(16063,5,0,'Invaders, cease this foolish venture at once! Turn away while you still can!',14,0,100,0,0,8917,0,13101,3,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT1'),(16063,6,0,'Perhaps they will come to their senses... and run away as fast as they can.',14,0,100,0,0,8918,0,13102,3,'zeliek SAY_ZELI_TAUNT2'),(16063,7,0,'%s casts Condemnation on everyone!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33088,3,'zeliek EMOTE_RAGECAST'),(16064,0,0,'C\'mon an\' fight ye wee ninny!',14,0,100,0,0,8899,0,13034,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_AGGRO'),(16064,1,2,'I\'m gonna\' enjoy killin\' these slack-jawed daffodils!',14,0,100,0,0,8905,0,13040,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT3'),(16064,2,0,'I like my meat extra crispy!',14,0,100,0,0,8902,0,13037,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_SPECIAl'),(16064,3,0,'Next time, bring more friends!',14,0,30,0,0,8901,0,13036,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_SLAY'),(16064,4,0,'What a bloody waste this is!',14,0,100,0,0,8900,0,13035,0,'korthazz SAY_KORT_DEATH'),(16064,5,0,'To arms, ye roustabouts! We\'ve got company!',14,0,100,0,0,8903,0,13038,3,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT1'),(16064,6,0,'I\'ve heard about enough a\' yer snivelin\'! Shut yer flytrap before I shut it for ye\'!',14,0,100,0,0,8904,0,13039,3,'korthazz SAY_KORT_TAUNT2'),(16065,0,0,'Defend yourself!',14,0,100,0,0,8892,0,13010,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_AGGRO'),(16065,1,2,'The first kill goes to me! Anyone care to wager?',14,0,100,0,0,8898,0,13016,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT3'),(16065,2,0,'Your life is mine!',14,0,100,0,0,8895,0,13013,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_SPECIAL'),(16065,3,0,'Who\'s next?',14,0,30,0,0,8894,0,13012,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_SLAY'),(16065,4,0,'Touche...',14,0,100,0,0,8893,0,13011,0,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_DEATH'),(16065,5,0,'Come, Zeliek, do not drive them out. Not before we\'ve had our fun!',14,0,100,0,0,8896,0,13014,3,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT1'),(16065,6,0,'I do hope they stay alive long enough for me to... introduce myself.',14,0,100,0,0,8897,0,13015,3,'blaumeux SAY_BLAU_TAUNT2'),(16065,7,0,'%s casts Unyielding Pain on everyone!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33087,3,'blaumeux EMOTE_RAGECAST'),(16098,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Empyrean'),(16113,0,0,'Thank you, Mrs. Chambers.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12140,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16113,0,1,'Is this a mango? Stupendous!',12,0,0,4,0,0,0,12141,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16113,0,2,'You\'ve really outdone yourself this time, Mrs. Chambers. Not a spot of mold to be found!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12142,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,0,0,'Your message did reach us, Commander, but by no means is our involvement here sanctioned by the Grand Crusader.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12047,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,1,0,'The heathens will be forced to react. Orcs, bull-men...',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12052,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,2,0,'Whatever. The revolting, unkempt Horde filth...',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,12054,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,3,0,'Too little, too late. The dam has broken. We are a bump in the road at best.',12,0,0,274,0,0,0,12056,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,4,0,'There is always... Ashbringer.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12058,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,5,0,'Thank you, Jessica.',12,0,0,2,0,0,0,12143,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16114,6,0,'And might I add, that dress is lovely! You must tell me where you got it from.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12144,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,0,0,'Your leader takes residence at the doorstep to Naxxramas. Do you think he does not feel the pressure?\n',12,0,0,6,0,0,0,12048,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,1,0,'%s lowers the sound of his voice to a whisper.',16,0,0,0,0,0,0,12049,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,2,0,'Even demons are capable of fear...',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12050,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,3,0,'Scourge activity in the Plaguelands has increased ten-fold. We are receiving reports of Scourge attacks from as far away as Kalimdor! Now how do you suppose this has happened? How have the wretched undead done that which was previously thought impossible? Is nowhere safe?',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12051,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,4,0,'Tauren.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12053,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,5,0,'You lack tact, Commander. This is not surprising. However, you are right in that the Horde will be forced to act. But not just the Horde. They already come - heroes from across the world.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12055,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,6,0,'So why are you here? What are we to do if there is no hope?',12,0,0,6,0,0,0,12057,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,7,0,'So this is what you have come for? To try and claim that which is the reason for the Dawn\'s existence and the Crusade\'s downfall? You open old wounds with your words, Commander!',12,0,0,6,0,0,0,12062,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,8,0,'The Ashbringer is dead and there will never be another like him. The lesser Mograine is a far cry from the man his father was. You know this, Commander! It was, after all, your own leadership that was responsible for the death of the Scarlet Highlord Mograine. ',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,12063,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,9,0,'It was your leadership that manipulated a grieving child to try and recover the sword. A child that has grown into a man with nothing but vengeance and hatred in his heart! And for what? You are no closer to the sword now than you were five years ago.\n',12,0,0,25,0,0,0,12065,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,10,0,'Yet you think that recovering Ashbringer will somehow turn the tide of battle? Let me let you in on a little secret, Commander: The power of the Ashbringer came from the man who would wield it... I was there, Commander. I watched him burn legions of undead in righteous fire before he would even unsheathe the blade. Alas, your grasp on history is ... lacking.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12066,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,11,0,'Now be silent and note where you are, lest I inform Lord Fordring and his knights that you are no longer here on amicable terms. I am certain he would take great pleasure in seeing to your \'atonement.\'',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,12067,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,12,0,'Delicious!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12139,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,12,1,'My compliments to the chef!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12137,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16115,12,2,'The fish is exquisite, Jessica.',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12138,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16116,0,0,'Indeed... lovely dress, Jessica.',12,0,0,273,0,0,0,12145,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16116,1,0,'The boar is superb!',12,0,0,4,0,0,0,12146,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16116,1,1,'Oh, quite succulent. Many thanks, Mrs. Chambers.',12,0,0,2,0,0,0,12147,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16118,0,0,'You think you can summon us? We are the ones that summon, not you! We bash you good for this and suck the marrow from your bones!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11968,0,'Kormok SAY_SPAWN'),(16118,1,0,'First Kormok crush your bones!  Then Kormok burn your soul!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11958,0,'Kormok SAY_AGGRO'),(16118,1,1,'You so little and puny... you no make good servants for Kormok!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,11959,0,'Kormok SAY_AGGRO'),(16118,2,0,'We am free! Thank you little, puny ones.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,11873,0,'Kormok SAY_DEATH'),(16118,3,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10645,0,'Kormok EMOTE_FRENZY'),(16128,0,0,'We received Brann\'s message, and we have begun preparations.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33982,0,'Rhonin'),(16128,1,0,'Citizens of Dalaran! Raise your eyes to the skies and observe!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33983,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,2,0,'Today our world\'s destruction has been averted in defiance of our very makers!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33984,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,3,0,'Algalon the Observer, herald of the titans, has been defeated by our brave comrades in the depths of the titan city of Ulduar.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33985,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,4,0,'Algalon was sent here to judge the fate of our world.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33986,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,5,0,'He found a planet whose races had deviated from the titans\' blueprints. A planet where not everything had gone according to plan.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33987,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,6,0,'Cold logic deemed our world not worth saving. Cold logic, however, does not account for the power of free will. It\'s up to each of us to prove this is a world worth saving.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33988,2,'Rhonin'),(16128,7,0,'That our lives... our lives are worth living.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33989,2,'Rhonin'),(16134,0,0,'Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,11946,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(16134,1,0,'Watch, druid. The earth still breathes. It yearns to be cleansed.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11946,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16135,0,0,'That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing.',12,0,100,273,0,0,0,11945,0,'Rayne'),(16135,1,0,'That is wonderous, Rimblat! Even this foul, sundered earth is not beyond healing.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,11945,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16218,0,0,'%s loses its link!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,12156,3,'Tesla Coil EMOTE_TESLA_LINK_BREAKS'),(16218,1,0,'%s overloads!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,12178,3,'Tesla Coil EMOTE_TESLA_OVERLOAD'),(16227,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Skymistress Gloaming'),(16244,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,7798,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16256,0,0,'Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12132,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,1,0,'Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,12133,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,2,0,'And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12134,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,3,0,'Please let me know if you need anything else!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,12135,0,'Jessica Chambers'),(16256,4,0,'Ok, you had the fish platter, Commander. Enjoy!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12132,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16256,5,0,'Father, you had the bowl of fruit? Right?',12,0,0,6,0,0,0,12133,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16256,6,0,'And for the ladies, roast baby boar. Enjoy!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12134,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16256,7,0,'Please let me know if you need anything else!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,12135,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16309,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Gangled Cannibal'),(16328,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'Vengeful Apparition'),(16378,0,0,'You will abide by our rules around here, miscreant!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,12276,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16378,0,1,'Your actions will not be tolerated!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,12275,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16378,0,2,'This is holy ground, heathen.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,12377,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16378,0,3,'You risk destroying us all, $r! You must be terminated!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,12376,0,'VMaNGOS'),(16441,0,0,'%s flees after seeing Kel\'Thuzad fall!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,12391,3,'Guardian of Icecrown EMOTE_FLEE'),(16441,1,0,'A Guardian of Icecrown enters the fight!