ll before the might of my army.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12988,3,'The Lich King SAY_DIALOGUE_SAPPHIRON_LICHKING'),(16980,2,0,'Invaders... here?! DESTROY them, Kel\'Thuzad! Naxxramas must not fall!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12989,3,'The Lich King SAY_DIALOGUE_SAPPHIRON_LICHKING2'),(16980,3,0,'Very well. Warriors of the frozen wastes, rise up! I command you to fight, kill and die for your master! Let none survive!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,12994,3,'The Lich King SAY_ANSWER_REQUEST'),(16980,4,0,'You will have your challenge, Fordring.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35747,0,'The Lich King SAY CHALLENGE'),(16980,5,0,'The souls of your fallen champions will be mine, Fordring.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35749,0,'The Lich King SAY SOULS WILL BE MINE'),(17000,0,0,'Fools!  You seek to abjure my father\'s presence?  Death awaits you, mortals!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13157,0,'Aggonis'),(17077,0,0,'%s lifts its head into the air, as if listening for something.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13430,0,'Ancestral Spirit Wolf'),(17077,1,0,'%s lets out a howl that rings across the mountains to the north and motions for you to follow.',16,0,100,0,0,9036,0,13446,0,'Ancestral Spirit Wolf'),(17085,0,0,'Avruu\'s magic... it still controls me.  You must fight me, mortal.  It\'s the only way to break the spell!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13448,0,'Aeranas'),(17085,1,0,'Avruu\'s magic is broken!  I\'m free once again!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13447,0,'Aeranas'),(17086,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Enraged Wraith'),(17220,0,0,'%s looks over at Temper as if reluctant to speak.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13694,0,'Hauteur Reborn'),(17220,1,0,'Thank you, shaman. I am reborn and will burn brighter than ever before!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13693,0,'Hauteur Reborn'),(17230,0,0,'Twinkle looks at Viera Sunwhisper with very hungry eyes.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,13595,0,'Twinkle'),(17300,0,0,'%s calls for help!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2541,0,'emote Text'),(17445,0,0,'Stillpine raiders, the time to strike is at hand! Charge!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,14038,0,'Stillpine the Younger'),(17528,0,0,'