s: Shivarra',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17373,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,23,0,'Function: Priestesses, Military Chaplains',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17391,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,24,0,'Devout and exceedingly charismatic, these priestesses live only to evangelize the power of Sargeras\' dread vision.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17400,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,25,0,'They are the driving heart of the Burning Crusade.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17812,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,26,0,'Dreadlord',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,16001,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,27,0,'Species: Nathrezim',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17374,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,28,0,'Function: Secret Police, Interrogator',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17392,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,29,0,'The Nathrezim are merciless villains who feed upon the energies of mortal creatures.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17401,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,30,0,'They utilize terror and subterfuge - often turning brother against brother as whole worlds fall before their dark influence.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17813,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,31,0,'Eredar',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,16002,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,32,0,'Function: Overlords, Strategists',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17393,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,33,0,'The cunning, powerful eredar warlocks were once our noble kinsmen.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17402,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,34,0,'Yet they fell to the lure of Sargeras\' evil - and now they have become our most stalwart enemies.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,18303,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,35,0,'Pit Lord',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,16003,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,36,0,'Species: Annihilan',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17376,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,37,0,'Function: Generals, Ground Commanders',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17394,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),(18896,38,0,'These colossal destroyers serve as the Legion\'s military commanders.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,17403,0,'Exodar Holographic Emitter'),