,0,''),(23224,0,27,'The answer is yes in here, I don\'t see why it would be any different out there.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21187,0,''),(23224,0,28,'Three words - \"ab - so - lutely\"!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21188,0,''),(23224,0,29,'Yes, but I hoped I would never have to answer that.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21189,0,''),(23224,0,30,'Ask me again later - I\'m trying to scratch my nose and it\'s hard to concentrate.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21190,0,''),(23224,0,31,'Why should I answer that?  Do you tell fortunes when people shake YOU?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21191,0,''),(23224,0,32,'Yes, it will rain.  That\'s not what you asked?  Too bad!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21192,0,''),(23224,0,33,'I\'m sorry, I can only speak Demonic.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21193,0,''),(23224,0,34,'Yes!  I mean no!  I mean... which answer gets me out of here?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21194,0,''),(23224,0,35,'Yes, No, Maybe so.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21195,0,''),(23224,0,36,'It won\'t matter, you\'ll be dead by tomorrow.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21196,0,''),(23224,0,37,'You should be asking \"Is that rogue behind me going to kill me?\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21197,0,''),(23224,0,38,'It\'s times like these that I wish I had a longer cooldown.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21198,0,''),(23224,0,39,'%s shrugs. Who knows?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21199,0,''),(23224,0,40,'It\'s like my mother always said: [Demonic] \"Razxx khaj jhashxx xashjx.\"',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21205,0,''),(23224,0,41,'%s is ignoring you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21206,0,''),(23224,0,42,'Why me?  Why not a goblin, or a gnome...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21207,0,''),(23224,0,43,'What happens in the twisting nether, stays in the twisting nether.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21208,0,''),(23224,0,44,'Avoid taking unnecessary gambles. Your lucky numbers are two, two and half, and eleven-teen.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21209,0,''),(23224,0,45,'Wouldn\'t you like to know?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21210,0,''),(23224,0,46,'Oh, oh, oh!  I can see this one clearly...  Nah, lost it.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21211,0,''),(23224,0,47,'This was NOT in my contract!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21212,0,''),(23224,0,48,'XRA RAHKI MAZIZRA!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21213,0,''),(23224,0,49,'4 8 15 16 23 42',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21214,0,''),(23224,0,50,'Are you making fun of me?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21215,0,''),(23224,0,51,'What kind of imp do you think I am?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21216,0,''),(23224,0,52,'Say please.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21217,0,''),(23224,0,53,'Want to trade places?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21218,0,''),(23224,0,54,'Do you ask this question to everything that\'s trapped in a ball?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21219,0,''),(23224,0,55,'Hey! You try arranging furniture with some jerk shaking your house!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21220,0,''),(23224,0,56,'I can make that happen. Just sign below the dotted line...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21221,0,''),(23224,0,57,'Reply hazy and slightly damp. Dry thoroughly and try again.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21222,0,''),(23224,0,58,'Concentrate (on releasing me from this infernal prison) and try again later.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21223,0,''),(23224,0,59,'Please insert 25 silver pieces and try again.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21224,0,''),(23224,0,60,'Are you my pal, Danny?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21225,0,''),(23224,0,61,'You remember the time you tried to drill that hole in your head?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21226,0,''),(23224,0,62,'Oh that\'s right, don\'t make any effort to make your own fortune!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21227,0,''),(23224,0,63,'Two words - imp-possible!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21228,0,''),(23224,0,64,'You need Arcane Intellect, because that answer is obvious!  NO!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21229,0,''),(23224,0,65,'Not on your life!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21230,0,''),(23224,0,66,'I don\'t have to be a fortune-telling imp to know the answer to that one - NO!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21231,0,''),(23224,0,67,'The odds are 32.33 (repeating of course) percent chance of success.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21232,0,''),(23224,0,68,'When Blackrock freezes over!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21233,0,''),(23224,0,69,'Hahahaha, you\'re kidding right?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21234,0,''),(23224,0,70,'Inconceivable!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21235,0,''),(23224,0,71,'My sources say \"no\". Before the torture, that is.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21236,0,''),(23224,0,72,'That\'s about as likely as me getting out of this ball.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21237,0,''),(23224,0,73,'You picked the wrong time to shake me today, buddy!  Prepare for disappointment.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21238,0,''),(23224,0,74,'Not unless you\'re some kind of super-person.  And don\'t kid yourself, you\'re not.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21239,0,''),(23224,0,75,'That\'s about as likely as me getting a date with a succubus.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21240,0,''),(23224,0,76,'My fortune telling powers are immeasurable - your chances are though: NO CHANCE',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21241,0,''),(23224,0,77,'NO - and don\'t try shaking me again for a better answer!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21242,0,''),(23224,0,78,'Yes is my answer...',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21243,0,''),(23224,0,79,'...NOT!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21244,0,''),(23224,0,80,'I\'m gonna have to give this one the big N-O.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21245,0,''),(23224,0,81,'The outlook is very bad - for YOU that is!  Haha, take it!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21246,0,''),(23224,0,82,'Survey says: BZZZT!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,21247,0,''),(23261,0,0,'Get away from my clutch!!!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21696,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,1,'I know you by your stench, little $n.  Here, in my perch, is where your bones shall finally rest.',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21706,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,2,'I tire of interruptions from the insignificant.  Your time has come, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21710,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,3,'The Skyguard shall pay for your temerity, $n!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21714,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,4,'I believe that I shall feast upon both $r and ogre flesh tonight.',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21718,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,5,'Little $r, you will now come to appreciate my wrath!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21720,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,6,'You have dared to defile my perch and must now be cleansed in fire!',14,0,100,0,0,7274,0,21726,0,'Furywing'),(23261,0,7,'What\'s this?!  $n and $g his : her; friend