aul must be brought in by ship and travel the length of Northrend to reach us.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24490,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,5,0,'Siege engines, ammunition, heavy armor... How do you propose to shatter the walls of Icecrown without those?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24493,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,6,0,'So the prodigal son has spoken!',12,1,100,5,0,0,0,24497,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,7,0,'Your father\'s blood runs strong in you, Hellscream. Impatient as always... Impatient and reckless.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24498,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,8,0,'You rush headlong into all-out war without a thought of the consequences.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24500,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,9,0,'I drank of the same blood your father did, Garrosh. Mannoroth\'s cursed venom pumped through my veins as well.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24502,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,10,0,'I drove my weapons into the bodies and minds of my enemies.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24503,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,11,0,'And while Grom died a glorious death - freeing us all from the blood curse - he could not wipe away the terrible memory of our past.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24504,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,12,0,'His act could not erase the horrors we committed. ',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24505,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,13,0,'%s pauses.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24506,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,14,0,'The winter after the curse was lifted, hundreds of veteran orcs like me were lost to despair.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24507,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,15,0,'Our minds were finally free, yes... Free to relive all of the unthinkable acts that we had performed under the Legions\' influence.',12,1,100,273,0,0,0,24508,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,16,0,'%s nods.',16,1,100,273,0,0,0,24509,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,17,0,'I think it was the sounds of the draenei children that unnerved most of them... You never forget...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24510,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,18,0,'Have you ever been to Jaggedswine Farm? When the swine are of age for the slaughter... It\'s that sound. The sound of the swine being killed... It resonates the loudest. Those are hard times for us older veterans.',12,1,100,6,0,0,0,24511,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,19,0,'%s shakes his head.',16,1,100,274,0,0,0,24513,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,20,0,'I am not speaking solely of the children of our enemies...',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24515,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,21,0,'%s pauses.',16,1,100,1,0,0,0,24506,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,22,0,'I won\'t let you take us down that dark path again, young Hellscream. I\'ll kill you myself before that day comes...',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24516,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,23,0,'I don\'t eat pork...',12,1,100,274,0,0,0,24519,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25256,24,0,'%s spits.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24520,0,'High Overlord Saurfang'),(25317,0,0,'What\'s the matter, $c?  Think you\'re too good to stand in line with the rest of us?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24758,0,'Civilian Recruit to Player'),(25317,1,0,'This is harder than it looks.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26488,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,1,'Did that seem okay?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26487,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,2,'My arm is getting sore.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26491,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,3,'Hmm....',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26492,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,4,'I think I\'m starting to get the hang of this.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26490,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,1,5,'This isn\'t easy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26489,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,0,'You aren\'t going to let me sleep are you?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26497,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,1,'Are you going to be doing this for much longer?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26502,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,2,2,'Could you try to be a little quieter?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26500,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,0,'I just don\'t want to let anyone down.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26494,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,1,'I need to do something to keep myself busy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26495,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25317,3,2,'I\'m just nervous.  Sorry.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26493,0,'Civilian Recruit'),(25324,0,1,'What is it you need?',12,0,100,1,1500,0,0,25739,0,'Earthen ring guide'),(25324,0,2,'Have you discovered something?',12,0,100,1,1500,0,0,25740,0,'Earthen ring guide'),(25324,0,3,'The elemental spirits are restless...',12,0,100,1,1500,0,0,25741,0,'Earthen ring guide'),(25396,0,0,'You should not have come here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13923,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25396,0,1,'You\'ll be joining the other guests now....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13924,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25396,0,2,'You cannot stop us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13925,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25396,0,3,'Your death will soon follow....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,13926,0,'Naxxanar Skeletal Mage'),(25401,0,0,'%s armed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24590,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,1,0,'Detonation in 5...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24591,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,2,0,'4...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24592,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,3,0,'3...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24593,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,4,0,'2...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24594,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25401,5,0,'1...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24595,0,'Seaforium Depth Charge'),(25416,0,0,'Who dares?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24675,0,'Simmer'),(25416,0,1,'I will turn your bones to ash!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24676,0,'Simmer'),(25416,0,2,'You will be consumed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24677,0,'Simmer'),(25416,0,3,'There is no escape from my rise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24678,0,'Simmer'),(25416,1,0,'STOP!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24666,0,'Simmer'),(25416,2,0,'Tell Imperean that I will consider a cessation of hostilities. But first, Churn must stop his watery intrusions upon my rise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24667,0,'Simmer'),(25416,3,0,'I grow bored with you. Begone!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24668,0,'Simmer'),(25418,0,0,'I... submit. As long as Simmer agrees to stop boiling my pool, I agree to an armistice.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24670,0,'Churn'),(25418,1,0,'Now, remove yourself from my presence. You would be wise not to come within sight of me again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24671,0,'Churn'),(25418,2,0,'WAIT... NO MORE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24669,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,0,'I will crush you under the weight of my waves!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24679,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,1,'You dare come into my pool?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24680,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,2,'Your death will not be pleasant!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24681,0,'Churn'),(25418,3,3,'Your corpse will feed my fish.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24682,0,'Churn'),(25426,0,0,'No, popo. They look kind of like the pigs. Are they pigs?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24632,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,1,0,'Are they cowardly pigs, popo?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24635,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,2,0,'But popo, what are they afraid of? Why are they here?',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24638,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,3,0,'%s scratches his head.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24642,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,4,0,'I... I don\'t understand, popo.',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24643,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,5,0,'%s puffs out his chest and stands on his tip-toes.',16,1,100,0,0,0,0,24644,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25426,6,0,'Lok\'tar ogar, popo!',12,1,100,1,0,0,0,24645,0,'Ug\'thor Bloodfrenzy'),(25510,0,0,'The Serpent\'s Maw is engulfed in tuskarr fire!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24722,0,'1st Kvaldir Vessel (The Serpent\'s Maw)'),(25511,0,0,'The Kur Drakkar is engulfed in tuskarr fire!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24723,0,'2nd Kvaldir Vessel (The Kur Drakkar)'),(25512,0,0,'Bor\'s Hammer is engulfed in tuskarr fire!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24724,0,'3rd Kvaldir Vessel (Bor\'s Hammer)'),(25513,0,0,'Bor\'s Anvil is engulfed in tuskarr fire!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24725,0,'4th Kvaldir Vessel (Bor\'s Anvil)'),(25596,0,0,'%s is cured!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24885,0,'Infected Kodo Beast'),(25608,0,0,'All my plans have led to this!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25544,0,'KJ - SAY_KJ_OFFCOMBAT1'),(25608,0,1,'Stay on task, do not waste time!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25545,0,'KJ - SAY_KJ_OFFCOMBAT2'),(25608,0,2,'I have waited long enough!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25546,0,'KJ - SAY_KJ_OFFCOMBAT3'),(25608,0,3,'Fail me and suffer for eternity!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25547,0,'KJ - SAY_KJ_OFFCOMBAT4'),(25608,0,4,'Drain the girl! Drain her power until there is nothing but a vacant shell!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25548,0,'KJ - SAY_KJ_OFFCOMBAT5'),(25745,0,0,'The Earthen Ring\'s Assault Begins.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,24930,1,'Ahune Bunny- EMOTE_EARTHEN_ASSAULT'),(25753,0,0,'Warning: $r incursion detected!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24978,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,0,1,'Activate counter-measures. Repel intruder.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24979,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,0,2,'Attention all units, $r inside the perimeter.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24980,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,0,3,'You have been detected. You will be assimilated or eliminated.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,24981,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(25753,1,0,'Warning! Warning! Intruder alert! Intruder alert!',14,0,100,0,0,5805,0,4142,0,'Sentry-bot 57-K'),(26045,0,0,'You will not master me, puny $r!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25149,0,'Storm Tempest'),(26073,0,0,'Who disturbs my meditation?!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,24619,0,'High Priest Talet-Kha'),(26185,0,0,' You worship death, little man?  Death is here!',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,25347,0,'Lurid'),(26185,0,1,' Master... you want... I kill puny priest?  Make painful, yes?',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,25345,0,'Lurid'),(26185,0,2,' Yes, weakling... beg Lurid for life!',12,0,100,35,0,0,0,25346,0,'Lurid'),(26185,1,0,' You Arthas lapdog?  You die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25835,0,'Lurid'),(26185,1,1,' Time to kill!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25833,0,'Lurid'),(26185,1,2,' Lurid could get used... to working with you.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25837,0,'Lurid'),(26185,1,3,' It\'s about time!  Lurid was getting bored.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25834,0,'Lurid'),(26185,1,4,' This not... end well for you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25836,0,'Lurid'),(26214,0,0,'You will not stop the Frost Lord from entering this world, mortal. The Tidehunter\'s might will crush that of Ragnaros once and for all, leaving your land a frozen paradise!',12,0,100,1,2000,0,0,25372,0,'Frigid Lieutenant intro speech'),(26215,0,0,'You will not stop the Frost Lord from entering this world, mortal. The Tidehunter\'s might will crush that of Ragnaros once and for all, leaving your land a frozen paradise!',12,0,100,1,2000,0,0,25372,0,'Glacial Lieutenant intro speech'),(26349,0,0,'You\'re too late! The accord has been negotiated. Only the details remain. Small details... like you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25716,0,'Goramosh'),(26401,0,0,'Thank you again, $n, for this delectable incense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25699,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,1,0,'%s devours the incense.  It\'s ravenous!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25717,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,2,0,'So good! So packed with energy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25718,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,3,0,'It has everything a growing scorchling needs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25719,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,4,0,'I can feel the power SURGING within me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25730,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,5,0,'%s bellows with laughter!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25720,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,6,0,'Now! Finally! Our plans can take effect!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25721,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,7,0,'KNEEL, LITTLE MORTAL! KNEEL BEFORE THE MIGHT OF THE HERALD OF RAGNAROS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25722,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,8,0,'YOU WILL ALL PERISH IN FLAMES!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25723,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,9,0,'%s blinks...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25724,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26401,10,0,'Ah. I was merely jesting...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25725,0,'Summer Scorchling'),(26421,0,0,'The %s is angered by your request and attacks!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26042,0,'emote text'),(26421,1,0,'Breaking off a piece of its bark, the %s hands it to you before departing.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,26041,0,'emote text'),(26520,0,0,'Thank you again, $n, for this delectable incense.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25699,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,1,0,'%s devours the incense.  It\'s ravenous!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25717,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,2,0,'So good! So packed with energy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25718,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,3,0,'It has everything a growing scorchling needs!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25719,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,4,0,'I can feel the power SURGING within me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25730,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,5,0,'%s bellows with laughter!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25720,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,6,0,'Now! Finally! Our plans can take effect!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25721,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,7,0,'KNEEL, LITTLE MORTAL! KNEEL BEFORE THE MIGHT OF THE HERALD OF RAGNAROS!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25722,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,8,0,'YOU WILL ALL PERISH IN FLAMES!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25723,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,9,0,'%s blinks...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25724,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26520,10,0,'Ah. I was merely jesting...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,25725,0,'Festival Scorchling'),(26527,0,0,'Oh, no! Adventurers, something awful has happened! A colleague of mine has been captured by the Infinite Dragonflight, and they\'re doing something horrible to him! Keeping Arthas is still your highest priority, but if you act fast you could help save a Guardian of Time!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32670,3,'Chromie'),(26527,1,0,'Adventurers, you must hurry! The Guardian of Time cannot last for much longer!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32678,3,'Chromie'),(26527,2,0,'I can barely sense the Guardian of Time! His timeline is fading quickly!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32679,3,'Chromie'),(26531,0,0,'%s is entranced by the sun\'s reflection on Zeh\'gehn\'s knife.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25732,0,'Mesmerized Frog'),(26531,1,0,'%s croaks eagerly while directing its gaze to the docked ship.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,25733,0,'Mesmerized Frog'),(26846,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Kareg'),(26850,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Numo Spiritbreeze'),(26853,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Makki Wintergale'),(26880,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Vana Grey'),(26881,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Palena Silvercloud'),(26966,0,0,'The boy believed he could essssscape... Neither of you shall make it out alive.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26102,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,1,'Kill ussss all... More will come for him...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26103,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,2,'Relent! This ssssoul iss not worth sssaving...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26104,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(26966,0,3,'You have made a grave misssstake...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26105,0,'Shadowy Tormentor'),(27119,0,0,'%s snickers, nuzzling into Sentinel Sweetspring\'s ankles.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29553,0,'Snowpaw'),(27364,0,0,'Hey Celidh!  Do you have any pets you want me to take over to the stable?',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26428,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,1,0,'Let\'s go boy.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26432,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,2,0,'If I were king, I\'d have a horse like you.  I\'d make sure you didn\'t get lost, and I bet you\'d make sure I never got lost.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26478,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,3,0,'We\'d be best friends.  I bet me and Anduin would also be best friends, too.  Friends are important.  ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26479,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27364,4,0,'I\'ll take you to some other horses.  You probably miss being around other horses.  They can be your friend too.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,26486,0,'Jimmy the Stable Boy'),(27435,0,0,'%s armed.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24590,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,1,0,'Detonation in 5...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24591,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,2,0,'4...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24592,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,3,0,'3...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24593,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,4,0,'2...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24594,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27435,5,0,'1...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24595,0,'Wintergarde Mine Bomb'),(27483,0,0,'%s raises his talons menacingly!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,26745,0,'King Dred EMOTE_SLASH'),(27570,0,0,'We\'re all gonna die!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26848,0,'venture co straggler SAY1'),(27570,0,1,'Gotta get out of here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26847,0,'venture co straggler SAY2'),(27570,0,2,'No way I\'m stickin\' around!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26851,0,'venture co straggler SAY3'),(27570,0,3,'Forget this! I\'m going home!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26850,0,'venture co straggler SAY4'),(27570,0,4,'I didn\'t sign up for this!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26849,0,'venture co straggler SAY5'),(27631,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,24144,0,'Angrathar Aberration on enrage'),(27646,0,0,'You won\'t eat me, will you?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26914,0,'Anya'),(27646,1,0,'Sister!  The mean men were going to take me to Badmoon Isle.  They wanted to turn me into one of them.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26918,0,'Anya'),(27646,2,0,'That\'s what I said!  Badmoon!  Sasha... don\'t ever leave me again!  First they took papa, then they took you... I don\'t want to be alone with them!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,26919,0,'Anya'),(27784,0,0,'Next, I shall speak of the most powerful entities within the pinnacle of Naxxramas. Truly, these are two of the greatest threats to all of Northrend.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27054,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Pinnacle of Naxxramas'),(27784,1,0,'Next, I shall speak of the death knight wing of Naxxramas. Within its corrupted halls, the echo of battle rings day and night, as our finest warriors are corrupted and twisted into the Scourge\'s greatest warriors.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27053,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Death knight wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,2,0,'Next, I shall speak of the blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas. There, the Scourge develop the strongest and most hideous aberrations of their armies.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27052,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Blighted abomination wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,3,0,'Next, I shall speak of the accursed spider wing of Naxxramas. It is there the Scourge breed even more poisonous and dangerous versions of their kin.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27051,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Accursed spider wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,4,0,'Next, I shall speak of the dread plague wing of Naxxramas, where the Scourge seek to improve upon the deadly blight which they spread across Lordaeron.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27050,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - Dread plague wing of Naxxramas'),(27784,5,0,'I shall leave this image on display for your perusal. Study your opponents\' strengths, for a creature\'s strength can also be its weakness.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27059,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer - End of talk'),(27784,6,0,'Sapphiron. Once a noble blue dragon within the mountains of Northrend, Sapphiron was slain by Arthas during his campaign through the frozen north. Resurrected to serve him, Sapphiron guards Kel\'thuzad\'s lair eternally, awaiting those who would dare tresspass upon his master.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27079,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,7,0,'The lich, Kel\'Thuzad. He serves the Lich King without question, a necromancer of great prowess in life, turned into a master of necromancy after his death. It is said he is the most loyal of the Lich King\'s subjects.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27080,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,8,0,'Kel\'thuzad has survived trials that would have long since shattered the souls of even the greatest of the Brotherhood. He readily gave his life at Arthas\'s hand, later to be brought back - reborn in the power of the Sunwell. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27081,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,9,0,'In the Plaguelands, Kel\'thuzad was again defeated by the agents of the Argent Dawn. However, his phylactery was delivered to a false agent of the Brotherhood. We have yet to discover who stole his phylactery or why. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27082,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,10,0,'Pay attention. This is Instructor Razuvious, Kel\'Thuzad\'s appointed trainer of all death knights. It is said that his own technique is so potent, only a disciple of his could possibly withstand his might.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27060,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,11,0,'Gothik, the Harvester. A master of necromancy and conjuration, Gothik is said to be able to beckon forth legions of the undead at a moment\'s notice. It is with his guidance that even the weakest of Death Knights can raise the dead.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27061,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,12,0,'The most powerful death knights within Naxxramas are the four horsemen. They represent the pinnacle of Kel\'Thuzad\'s guard. The first, Thane Korth\'azz, holds the power of flame. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27062,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,13,0,'The next, Lady Blaumeux, calls forth the power of shadows, drawing the souls of the living into the voracious embrace.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27063,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,14,0,'Sir Zeliek, a paladin in life, so strong in his faith, that even in undeath, the power of the light still heeds his call, smiting his foes in battle.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27064,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,15,0,'The final death knight, Lord Mograine, was the finest warrior that the death knights had ever seen. However, after the events in Azeroth, he vanished without a trace. It is yet to be seen who Kel\'Thuzad has appointed in his place.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27065,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,16,0,'Behold, Patchwerk. When word of his existence first reached the ears of the Brotherhood, none believed the tales of an abomination with such immense speed and strength. Fewer still believed it when he fell the first time...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,27074,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,17,0,'Grobbulus, the first of what was to be an army of flesh giants. It carried the plague slime of Naxxramas within its body, injecting the living ooze into the bodies of its foe. The recipient of this foul injection would usually flee to his allies, bringing them down with him.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27075,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,18,0,'Gluth, the foul plague-dog of Naxxramas, was said to have an appetite so voracious that even the living were not enough to satisfy his hunger. Feugen was said to feed him an army of zombies daily, recycling the remains of undead too weak to use in combat.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27077,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,19,0,'Thaddius, built from the flesh of women and children, it is said that their souls are fused together - eternally bound within that foul prison of flesh. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27078,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,20,0,'Anub\'Rekhan, one of the finest Spider Lords of Azjol\'Nerub, was brought under the control of the Scourge when he and his former commander, Anub\'arak, were finally defeated by Lich King many years ago. It is said that he was the most loyal of Anub\'arak\'s commanders.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27066,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,21,0,'The Grand Widow Faerlina, a botanist in life, breeder and caretaker of arachnids in death, she overseers the spider wing, developing the most potent of poisons for the Lich King. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27070,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,22,0,'Maexxna, born deep within the mountains of Northrend many ages ago, she was captured within the dread citadel Naxxramas, where she gives birth to her brood, feeding them the corpses of all who dare venture too deeply into Naxxramas.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27073,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,23,0,'Behold, Noth the Plaguebringer. Responsible for the creation of the process that distills the souls of the living and places them within the cold cage of undeath, Noth was observed to be refining this process even now. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27055,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,24,0,'Observe, Heigan the Unclean. The mastermind behind the plague cauldrons that turned the wilderness of Azeroth into the Plaguelands. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27056,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,25,0,'It is said that Heigan has rigged the very walls and floors of Naxxramas itself with a vast array of traps, which he can trigger at will.',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27057,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27784,26,0,'Loatheb. The hideous result of fusing the living plague of the Plaguelands with the bog beasts of Azeroth, Loatheb is said to control the power of healing itself. ',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,27058,0,'Commander Eligor Dawnbringer'),(27871,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,38630,0,'Flesheating Ghoul'),(27892,0,0,'%s begins to growl...',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27237,0,'LINE_SCRUFFY1'),(27899,2,0,'I can\'t believe that I used to wear that.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27301,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,1,'Look at you fight; no wonder I turned to drinking.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27304,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,2,'What? Am I here alone. We both have a stake in this, you know!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27305,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,3,'No matter what, you can\'t die, because that would mean that I would cease to exist, right? But, I was here before when I was you. I\'m so confused!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27306,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,4,'Wow, I\'d forgotten how inexperienced I used to be.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27307,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,5,'Sorry, but Chromie said that I couldn\'t reveal anything about your future to you. She said that if I did, I would cease to exist.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27311,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,6,'Wish I could remember how many of the Infinite Dragonflight were going to try to stop you. This fight was so long ago.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27312,0,'Future You'),(27899,2,7,'Listen. I\'m not supposed to tell you this, but there\'s going to be this party that you\'re invited to. Whatever you do, DO NOT DRINK THE PUNCH!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,27313,0,'Future You'),(27915,0,0,'Good work with the crates! Come talk to me in front of Stratholme for your next assignment!',15,0,0,0,0,0,0,30509,3,'Chromie - SAY_EVENT_START'),(27915,1,0,'Come over here time traveller, we need to talk!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29167,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(27915,1,1,'Quick, over here!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29169,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(27915,1,2,'We meet again, time traveller!',15,0,100,70,0,0,0,29168,0,'Chromie - WHISPER_COME_TALK'),(28092,0,0,'Omega Rune deployed.  Activation successful.',12,0,100,51,0,0,0,33004,0,'The Etymidian'),(28176,0,0,'Let us see if it is truly impervious.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27783,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(28176,1,0,'Nothing.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27766,0,'Rimblat Earthshatter'),(28177,0,0,'By the Goddess. It\'s as if Nature can\'t touch it!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27763,0,'Rayne'),(28177,1,0,'Gah!',12,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27786,0,'Rayne'),(28213,0,0,'The %s screams with rage and rushes to the aid of her babies.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,27607,0,'Hardknuckle Matriarch'),(28229,0,0,'More intruders? You\'ll soon learn, no one messes with the Venture Company!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,27611,0,'Venture Co. Air Patrol'),(28244,0,0,'Now we will see why this ore is so important to the Scourge.',12,0,100,16,0,0,0,27746,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,1,0,'Korfax, what can you tell from this saronite?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27747,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,2,0,'Rayne, Rimblat, what about the power of nature and the elements?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27759,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,3,0,'Metz?',12,0,100,6,0,0,0,27767,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,4,0,'You know what.',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27768,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,5,0,'%s dusts himself off.',16,0,100,0,0,9410,0,27789,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,6,0,'Clearly this is getting us nowhere. We need to get this saronite to Highlord Fordring for further study.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27774,0,'Eitrigg'),(28244,7,0,'Thank you for trying, my friends. We\'ll unlock its secrets. Hopefully before it\'s too late.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27775,0,'Eitrigg'),(28357,0,0,'This one...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27876,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,0,'The Lich King will be pleased with this initiate.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27869,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,1,'Amidst the wretch, a champion has been found.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27870,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,2,'CHAOS! DOOM! DESTRUCTION! This one will claim them all!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27871,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,3,'Marvel at its tenacity and vigor! A champion has been found!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27868,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,1,4,'A harbinger of death is reborn...',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27872,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,2,0,'Place upon it the trappings befitting a herald of Arthas.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27873,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,3,0,'Stand and be measured! Rise, for your master awaits your arrival. Go now!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27883,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,3,1,'Listen, death knight... Listen for the voice of your master. He calls to you now.',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,27884,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,0,'Pathetic...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27865,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,1,'Useless...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27862,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,2,'Another failure...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27861,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,4,3,'This one has awoken too soon. It retains emotion and memory...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27864,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,5,0,'You have been measured and found wanting...',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,27866,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28357,6,0,'Dispose of it...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,27867,0,'Instructor Razuvious'),(28473,0,0,'You leave your material body behind!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,28025,0,'Material You'),(28604,0,0,'Ouch! Watch where you\'re tugging!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,28592,0,'adventurous dwarf SAY_DWARF_OUCH'),(28604,1,0,'Glad I could help!',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,28593,0,'adventurous dwarf SAY_DWARF_HELP'),(28608,0,0,'The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29717,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(28608,0,1,'Let the purging begin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29720,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(28608,0,2,'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29719,0,'Scarlet Medic'),(28608,0,3,'Scourge filth! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28597,0,'Scarlet Medic - On Aggro'),(28608,0,4,'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28599,0,'Scarlet Medic - On Aggro'),(28608,0,5,'By the Light be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28602,0,'Scarlet Medic - On Aggro'),(28608,0,6,'Light bless you, my child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28603,0,'Scarlet Medic - On Aggro'),(28610,0,0,'What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29133,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,1,'Tell me what you know about \"Crimson Dawn\" or the beatings will continue!\'',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29134,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,2,'I\'m through being courteous with your kind, human! What is the \"Crimson Dawn?\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29135,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,3,'\"Crimson Dawn!\" What is it! Speak!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29136,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,4,'I can keep this up for a very long time, Scarlet dog! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn!\"',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29137,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,5,'I\'ll tear the secrets from your soul! Tell me about the \"Crimson Dawn\" and your life may be spared!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29138,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,6,'Is your life worth so little? Just tell me what I need to know about \"Crimson Dawn\" and I\'ll end your suffering quickly.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29139,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,0,7,'I grow tired of these games, human. Tell me of the \"Crimson Dawn\" or I will tear your spine out with my bare hands!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29140,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,0,'I\'ll tell you nothing, Scourge filth!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29141,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,1,'You\'\'ll have to kill me, monster. I will tell you NOTHING!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29142,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,2,'Argh... The pain... The pain is almost as unbearable as the lashings I received in grammar school when I was but a child.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29143,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,3,'You... You\'ll get nothing... And like it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29144,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,4,'Do you think this to be pain? To be suffering? HAH! Destroy this mortal shell so that I may ascend to the heavens!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29145,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,5,'You hit like a girl. Honestly. Is that the best you can do?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29146,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,6,'The crimson what? Never heard of it...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29147,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,7,'The pain is momentary. It pales in comparison to what the High General would do to me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29148,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,8,'You know nothing of pain, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29155,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,9,'HAH! I\'ve survived three separate inquisitions! This is nothing in comparison!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29156,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,10,'Look out! There\'s a bee loose and it\'s on a stinging rampage!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29157,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,11,'That one tickled...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29158,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,12,'I\'m going to send you back to the Lich King in pieces!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29159,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,13,'You\'ll be hanging in the gallows shortly, Scourge fiend!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29160,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,14,'I used to work for Grand Inquisitor Isillien! Your idea of pain is a normal mid-afternoon for me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29161,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,1,15,'ARGH! You burned my last good tabard!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29162,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,2,0,'I\'ll tell you everything! STOP! PLEASE!',12,0,100,20,0,0,0,29149,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,3,0,'We... We have only been told that the \"Crimson Dawn\" is an awakening. You... You see, the Light speaks to the High General. It is the Light...',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29150,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,4,0,'The Light that guides us. This movement was set in motion before you came... We... We do as we are told. It is what must be done.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29151,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,5,0,'I know very litte else... The High General chooses who may go and who must stay behind. There\'\'s nothing else... You must believe me!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29152,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,6,0,'LIES! The pain you are about to endure will be talked about for years to come!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29163,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,8,0,'%s dies from the torture.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,29154,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,0,'Scourge filth! DIE!, Scourge filth! DIE!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28597,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,1,'The Crusade will be victorious!, The Crusade will be victorious!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28598,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,2,'I will present your head to Abbendis myself!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28599,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,3,'You\'re not welcome in these lands, monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28600,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,4,'Let the purging begin!, Let the purging begin!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28601,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28610,9,5,'By the Light be cleansed!, By the Light be cleansed!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28602,0,'Scarlet Marksman'),(28671,0,0,'What is this you pathetic, little worm? Come to die?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28837,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,1,0,'I recognize your stench. You\'re the one who stealthed by me on the back of that snow leopard runt!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28838,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,2,0,'What? How is this possible?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28833,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,3,0,'Wait... STOP! You can\'t take back the power!!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28877,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28671,4,0,'NOOOOooooooooooooooooo!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,28855,0,'Prophet of Quetz\'lun'),(28683,0,0,'Dirty, stinkin\', horse thief!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28675,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,0,1,'Nobody steals Kitrik\'s horses!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28676,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,0,2,'You\'ll be hanging at the gallows soon...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28677,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,0,3,'How many more of you do I need to send back to the Lich King in pieces before he\'ll stop?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28678,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,1,0,'And keep the change, ya filthy animal!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28702,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,1,1,'Perhaps you\'ll think twice about stealin\' one of Kitrik\'s horses next time, eh?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28703,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,1,2,'Is that all you got?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28704,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,1,3,'What a colossal waste of time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28705,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28683,1,4,'At least make me work for it next time.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,28706,0,'Stable Master Kitrik'),(28948,0,0,'Ahh... there you are. The master told us you\'d be arriving soon.',12,0,100,4,0,0,0,29127,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,2,0,'Ever since his arrival from Drak\'Tharon, the master has spoken of the time you would be joining him here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,29172,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,3,0,'You should feel honored. You are the first of the master\'s prospects to be shown our operation.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29171,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,4,0,'The things I show you now must never be spoken of outside Voltarus. The world shall come to know our secret soon enough!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29173,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,5,0,'Here lie our stores of blight crystal, without which our project would be impossible.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29174,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,6,0,'I understand that you are to thank for the bulk of our supply.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29175,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,7,0,'These trolls are among those you exposed on the battlefield. Masterfully done, indeed....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29176,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,8,0,'We feel it best to position them here, where they might come to terms with their impending fate.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29433,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,9,0,'This is their destiny....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29434,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,10,0,'The blight slowly seeps into their bodies, gradually preparing them for their conversion.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29435,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,11,0,'This special preparation grants them unique powers far greater than they would otherwise know.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29436,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,12,0,'Soon, the master will grant them the dark gift, making them fit to serve the Lich King for eternity!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29437,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,13,0,'Stay for as long as you like, $n. Glory in the fruits of your labor!',12,0,100,5,0,0,0,29438,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,14,0,'Your service has been invaluable in fulfilling the master\'s plan. May you forever grow in power....',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,29439,0,'Malmortis say'),(28948,15,0,'Farewell',12,0,100,2,0,0,0,29440,0,'Malmortis say'),(28989,0,0,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32809,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,1,'Greetings.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32935,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,2,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32811,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,3,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32808,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,4,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32810,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,5,'Welcome.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32936,0,'Aemara'),(28989,0,6,'Welcome!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32807,0,'Aemara - Player In Range'),(29113,0,0,'We need more flesh!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,29634,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(29113,0,1,'Double your efforts! The final assault draws near!',14,0,100,5,0,0,0,29639,0,'Noth the Plaguebringer'),(29319,0,0,'It\'s an angry male!',42,0,100,0,0,473,0,33191,0,'Icepaw Bear'),(29319,1,0,'It\'s a female.',42,0,100,0,0,473,0,33192,0,'Icepaw Bear'),(29491,0,0,'Welcome. May I help you find something?',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32811,0,'Karandonna'),(29491,0,1,'Welcome.',12,0,100,3,0,0,0,32936,0,'Karandonna'),(29491,0,2,'Welcome!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32807,0,'Karandonna - Player In Range'),(29491,0,3,'Greetings, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32808,0,'Karandonna - Player In Range'),(29491,0,4,'Greetings! Please have a look around.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32809,0,'Karandonna - Player In Range'),(29491,0,5,'Let me know if you need help finding anything, $c.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32810,0,'Karandonna - Player In Range'),(29491,0,6,'Greetings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32935,0,'Karandonna - Player In Range'),(29655,0,0,'Saragosa! What has become of you?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,25480,0,'Malygos'),(29677,0,0,'The %s sniffs the ground to pickup the trail.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,30366,0,'Frosthound to Player'),(29677,1,0,'You\'ve been seen! Use the net and ice slick to keep the dwarves away!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,30365,0,'Frosthound to Player'),(29769,0,0,'Crush... maim... DESTROY!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30461,0,'Vile'),(29769,1,0,'Vile free? Vile love $n!',12,0,100,34,0,1446,0,30460,0,'Vile'),(29860,0,0,'SMASH!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,30471,0,'Vile'),(29881,0,0,'They are coming for you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30483,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,1,'Give in to your fear.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30484,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,2,'Kill them all... before they kill you.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30485,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,3,'They have turned against you. Now... take your revenge.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30486,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,4,'Tell yourself again that these are not truly your friends.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30487,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,5,'There is no escape. Not in this life. Not in the next.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30488,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,6,'You are a pawn of forces unseen.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30489,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(29881,0,7,'It WAS your fault.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,30490,0,'An Unknown Voice'),(30023,1,0,'Korrak has come, weaklings! Snowfall belongs to Winterax! Erm, Korrak mean to say amphitheater belong to Winterax!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,30705,0,'Korrak the Bloodrager'),(30023,2,0,'No graveyard here for you to play wicked games on Korrak! DIE!',14,0,100,15,0,0,0,30706,0,'Korrak the Bloodrager'),(30411,0,0,'Look, Lagnus, I consider you a capable man, but my patience is wearing thin. I know that Muradin is here, can you point me to him or not?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31084,0,'Magni'),(30411,1,0,'Brother! There you are! I can barely believe my eyes... you\'re alive!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,31085,0,'Magni'),(30411,2,0,'It\'s so good to see you again, Muradin. And what\'s this I heard about you being a King in your own right now? The Bronzebeards were always destined to greatness.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31086,0,'Magni'),(30411,3,0,'So it seems! And you haven\'t lost any muscle yourself. Do you remember anything of what happened, Muradin? Fate as turned ill in your absence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31088,0,'Magni'),(30411,4,0,'Magni nods.',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,31092,0,'Magni'),(30411,5,0,'He\'s not the boy of your memories anymore, Muradin. He\'s become something else entirely.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31093,0,'Magni'),(30411,6,0,'Are you sure Muradin? I just got you back after years of thinking you were dead. I do not want to lose you again.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31099,0,'Magni'),(30411,7,0,'So be it then. I have to return to my people, brothers. Come back to me in one piece.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31101,0,'Magni'),(30411,8,0,'...farewell brother.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31129,0,'Magni'),(30549,0,0,'You seek death?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13051,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO1'),(30549,0,1,'None shall pass!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13052,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO2'),(30549,0,2,'Be still!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13053,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_AGGRO3'),(30549,1,2,'Life is meaningless. It is in death that we are truly tested.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13060,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT3'),(30549,2,0,'Bow to the might of the Scourge!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13057,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SPECIAL'),(30549,3,0,'You will find no peace in death.',14,0,30,0,0,0,0,13055,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SLAY1'),(30549,3,1,'The master\'s will is done.',14,0,30,0,0,0,0,13056,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_SLAY2'),(30549,4,0,'Death... will not stop me.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,33116,0,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_DEATH'),(30549,5,0,'Enough prattling. Let them come. We shall grind their bones to dust.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13058,3,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT1'),(30549,6,0,'Conserve your anger. Harness your rage. You will all have outlets for your frustrations soon enough.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,13059,3,'rivendare SAY_RIVE_TAUNT2'),(30899,0,0,'Warning: life form pattern not recognized. Archival processing terminated.  Continued interference will result in targeted response.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29561,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_INTRO_3_ABED'),(30899,1,0,'Critical threat index. Void analysis diverted. Initiating sanitization protocol.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29577,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_C_2_ABED'),(30899,2,0,'Alert: security fail-safes deactivated. Beginning memory purge and... ',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29579,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_D_2_ABED'),(30899,3,0,'System online. Life form pattern recognized.  Welcome, Branbronzan.  Query?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,29580,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_D_4_ABED'),(30899,4,0,'Accessing prehistoric data... retrieved. In the beginning the earthen were created to--',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30611,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_03_ABED'),(30899,5,0,'Accessing... In the early stages of it\'s development cycle, Azeroth suffered infection by parasitic necrophotic symbiotes.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30612,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_05_ABED'),(30899,6,0,'Designation: Old Gods. Old Gods rendered all systems, including earthen, defenseless in order to facilitate assimilation. This matrix destabilization has been termed \"the Curse of Flesh\". Effects of destabilization increased over time.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30613,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_07_ABED'),(30899,7,0,'Acknowledged, Branbronzan. Session terminated.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,30614,0,'brann SAY_EVENT_END_21_ABED'),(30920,0,0,'What little geist want?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31614,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,1,'Present?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31609,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,2,'That not nice!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31615,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,3,'What bomb thing for?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31610,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,4,'Want me to deliver somewhere?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31611,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,5,'I not sure this safe, little geist.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31612,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,6,'This no go here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31613,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30920,0,7,'For me?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31608,0,'Lumbering Atrocity'),(30992,1,0,'Oh, bravo. Do you feel proud of yourself now that you\'ve unleashed this terrible mistake?',12,0,100,21,0,0,0,31550,0,'Doctor Sabnok'),(30992,2,0,'I already had him scheduled for disposal, but I suppose we can speed up the process a bit.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,31551,0,'Doctor Sabnok'),(30992,3,0,'It\'s a pity so many fine, and reusable, parts will go to waste... ',12,0,100,11,0,0,0,31553,0,'Doctor Sabnok'),(31036,0,0,'The first of the Horde towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,33299,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31036,1,0,'The second tower has fallen! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,33300,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31036,2,0,'The Horde towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!',14,7,100,0,0,0,0,33301,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31036,3,0,'Show those animals no mercy, $n!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,33101,0,'Commander Zanneth'),(31057,0,0,'Hello. Master Fras Siabi is not in at this time. Please come back tomorrow to Fras Siabi\'s Premium Tobacco! Beep!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,31716,0,'Mechanical Greeter RY7R'),(31091,0,0,'The first of the Alliance towers has fallen! Destroy all three and we will hasten their retreat!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33296,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,1,0,'Lok\'tar! The second tower falls! Destroy the final tower and we will hasten their retreat!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33297,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,2,0,'The Alliance towers have fallen! We have forced their hand. Finish off the remaining forces!',14,1,100,0,0,0,0,33298,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31091,3,0,'Slay them all, $n!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,33109,0,'Commander Dardosh'),(31108,0,0,'Stop the Horde from retrieving the embers, $n. We cannot risk them having the advantage when the battle resumes!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,33102,0,'Siege Master Stouthandle'),(31397,0,0,'AHAHAHAHA... you\'ll join us soon enough!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32473,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,1,'I don\'t want to leave! I want to stay here!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32471,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,2,'NO! You\'re wrong! The voices in my head are beautiful!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32470,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,3,'My life for you!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32467,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,4,'I\'m coming, master!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32466,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,5,'I won\'t leave!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32469,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,6,'I\'ll never return. The whole reason for my existence awaits below!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32472,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,0,7,'I must get further underground to where he is. I must jump!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,32474,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,0,'Please, no more.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32506,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,1,'Hit me again and you\'ll regret it!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32507,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,2,'Ow!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32508,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,3,'I\'m sorry. I\'ll work harder.',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32509,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31397,1,4,'Soon the master will reclaim me!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,32510,0,'Saronite Mine Slave'),(31426,0,0,'Guards!',14,6,100,0,0,0,0,4583,0,'Doras'),(31814,0,0,'Welcome, Brann Bronzebeard. I am all that remains of this temple\'s guardian.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32386,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,1,0,'You have proven yourself as an explorer and seeker of knowledge.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32387,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,2,0,'You have been a steadfast ally to the Earthen.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32388,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,3,0,'You and your companion have proven yourselves in combat and in the pursuit of the keystone.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32389,0,'A Distant Voice'),(31814,4,0,'Your motives are pure. The keystone\'s parts shall be reunited. Go to Ulduar and learn the answers to your questions, Brann Bronzebeard.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,32390,0,'A Distant Voice'),(32331,0,0,'Whoa! You\'re me, but from the future!  Hey, my equipment got an upgrade.  Cool!',15,0,100,25,0,0,0,32764,0,'Past You'),(32331,1,0,'Here come the Infinites!  I\'ve got to keep the hourglass safe.  Can you help?',15,0,100,6,0,0,0,32769,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,0,'This equipment looks cool and all, but couldn\'t we have done a little better?  Are you even raiding?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32770,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,1,'So, how does it all turn out in Icecrown?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32771,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,2,'Chromie said that if I don\'t do this just right, I might wink out of existence.  If I go, then you go!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32772,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,3,'Looks like I\'m an underachiever.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32773,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,4,'I think I\'m going to turn to drinking after this.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32774,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,5,'It might help if you could tell me how many of these guys we\'re going to fight.  You can remember that, right, grandpa?',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32775,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,6,'I just want you to know that if we get through this alive, I\'m making sure that we turn out better than you.  No offense.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32776,0,'Past You'),(32331,2,7,'Wait a minute!  If you\'re here, then that means that in the not-so-distant future I\'m going to be you helping me?  Are we stuck in a time loop?!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,32777,0,'Past You'),(32451,0,0,'Sometimes it\'s nice to get away from the sanctum and get some fresh air.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33067,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32451,0,1,'Luckily, the Lich King\'s grasp has not reached Dalaran yet.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33068,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32451,0,2,'She said to meet her right here... maybe I\'m in the wrong place?',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33069,0,'Dalaran Citizen'),(32738,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33031,0,'Kat Sunflower'),(32738,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33032,0,'Kat Sunflower'),(32739,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,33031,0,'Baroness Zildjia'),(32739,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,33032,0,'Baroness Zildjia'),(32740,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33031,0,'Archmage Rheaume'),(32740,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33032,0,'Archmage Rheaume'),(32741,0,0,'The view up here is amazing!',12,0,0,5,0,0,0,33031,0,'Conjurer Weinhaus'),(32741,0,1,'Too bad I left my light feathers at home... Slow Fall would work perfect here!',12,0,0,1,0,0,0,33032,0,'Conjurer Weinhaus'),(33008,0,0,'It\'s an angry male!',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,33191,0,'Male Icepaw Bear'),(33079,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(33233,0,0,'Harpoon Turret is ready for use!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,33857,0,'Razorscale Controller EMOTE_HARPOON'),(33280,0,0,'Weak-minded fool!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34359,0,'Voice of Yogg-Saron - WHISPER_VOICE_PHASE_1_WIPE'),(33280,1,0,'Your will is no longer your own.',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34363,0,'Voice of Yogg-Saron - WHISPER_VOICE_INSANE'),(33280,1,1,'Destroy them, minion! Your master commands it!',15,0,100,0,0,0,0,34364,0,'Voice of Yogg-Saron - WHISPER_VOICE_INSANE'),(33436,0,0,'Bad news, sire.',12,0,100,66,0,0,0,33664,0,'Garona'),(33436,1,0,'The clans are united under Blackhand in this assault. They will stand together until Stormwind has fallen.',12,0,100,274,0,0,0,33665,0,'Garona'),(33436,2,0,'Gul\'dan is bringing up his warlocks by nightfall. Until then, the Blackrock clan will be trying to take the Eastern Wall.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,33666,0,'Garona'),(33436,3,0,'The orc leaders agree with your assessment.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33667,0,'Garona'),(33456,0,0,'No matter how it all ends, you will die here.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,96874,0,'on Aggro Text'),(33686,0,0,'I was constructed to serve as a repository for essential information regarding this complex. My primary functions include communicating the status of the frontal defense systems and assessing the status of the entity that this complex was built to imprison.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33703,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_1'),(33686,1,0,'Access to the interior of the complex is currently restricted. Primary defensive emplacements are active. Secondary systems are currently non-active.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33705,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_2'),(33686,2,0,'Compromise of complex detected, security override enabled - query permitted.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33707,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_3'),(33686,3,0,'Primary defensive emplacements consist of iron constructs and Storm Beacons, which will generate additional constructs as necessary. Secondary systems consist of orbital defense emplacements.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33712,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_4'),(33686,4,0,'Entity designate: Yogg-Saron. Security has been compromised. Prison operational status unknown. Unable to contact Watchers for notification purposes.',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,33711,0,'Norgannon SAY_EVENT_5'),(33874,0,0,'Entry denied.  Access level insufficient.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33894,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,1,0,'Ninety-nine point nine nine percent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33902,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,2,0,'That\'s repeating, of course.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33903,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,3,0,'Commencing watcher Freya status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33872,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,4,0,'Watcher powers augmented by presence of elder servants.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33873,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,5,0,'Analyzing Elder Brightleaf enhancement.... Persistent area defenses powered by solar amplification.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33874,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,6,0,'Elder Stonebark analysis reveals a sonic defense that disrupts use of magic.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33875,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,7,0,'Elder Ironbranch scans have uncovered plant-based immobilization mechanisms.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33876,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,8,0,'In addition, my analysis links each elder to an increase in Freya\'s spellcasting, physical, or summoning capabilities.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33877,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,9,0,'Destruction of elder servants will result in loss of enhancements on watcher Freya. However, permanent damage to Freya\'s person and possessions, including her watcher sigil, highly probable.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33878,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,10,0,'Commencing watcher Hodir status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33883,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,11,0,'Hodir\'s sigil appears to be located inside a cache of artifacts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33884,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,12,0,'Watcher Hodir\'s temperament and behavior highly unstable. Destruction of cache highly probable during prolonged combat.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33885,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,13,0,'Allies present in the field of battle are likely to provide synergies and minimize combat duration.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33886,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,14,0,'Preservation of cache is essential to recovering Hodir\'s sigil.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34059,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,15,0,'Commencing watcher Thorim status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33880,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,16,0,'An external influence, under illusory guise of Thorim\'s deceased mate, Sif, has been detected.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33881,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,17,0,'Mental interference from this presence dangerously close to triggering partial memory damage.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33882,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,18,0,'Tactical analysis suggests approaching the arena from the front and splitting secondary force through a side passage at the ground level. This will maximize odds of reaching Thorim\'s outlook before mental domination by external presence is complete.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34058,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,19,0,'Commencing watcher Mimiron status analysis.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33887,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,20,0,'Watcher Mimiron\'s sigil is linked to a self-destruct mechanism connected to the entirety of the Corridors of Ingenuity.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33888,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,21,0,'Trigger for self-destruct mechanism is codenamed \"Big Red Button\", Mimiron\'s own creation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33889,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,22,0,'To retrieve Mimiron\'s sigil, initiate self-destruct sequence and defeat Mimiron before its completion.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33890,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,23,0,'Access to the Archivum granted.  Intrusion protection mechanisms suspended.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33895,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,24,0,'Initiating query.  The Algalon Failsafe is an automated emergency signal following a Prime Designate\'s demise.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33896,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,25,0,'Affirmative.  Timestamp of Prime Designate Loken\'s destruction coincides with signal activation.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33897,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,26,0,'Searching...  Destruction of Prime Designate is considered the first warning sign of systemic  planetary failure.  Algalon observer entity\'s arrival is followed by planetary diagnostics resulting in one of two possible reply signals.  Reply-code Alpha, signaling \"All is well\" and Reply-code Omega, signaling planetary re-origination.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33898,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,27,0,'The decomposition of the planet and its living organisms into base elements: metals, rocks, gases. This is followed by a period of reconstitution of each element into the original planetary blueprint.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33899,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,28,0,'Request denied.  Reply-codes built into Algalon observer entity.  He is both messenger and message.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33900,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,29,0,'Algalon diagnostics assess danger of systemic Old God corruption in planetary vital functions.  Calculating chance of Omega Reply-code...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33901,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,30,0,'Request denied. Access requires manual verification of the four watchers\' sigils.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33937,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,31,0,'The four watchers of Ulduar: Freya, Thorim, Hodir, and Mimiron. The sigils are tied to their physical and mental integrity. All four sigils are required for access to the Celestial Planetarium.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33938,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,32,0,'Analyzing watcher status. Please wait.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33939,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,33,0,'Corruption found. External influence gaining control over watchers. Sigils compromised.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33940,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,34,0,'Sufficient use of force would trigger a reset in watcher functions, removing the external influence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33941,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,35,0,'As for not endangering the sigils during this process, I can analyze each watcher\'s status and make that information available to you upon completion of calculations.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,33942,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,36,0,'Fragment analysis underway.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34061,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,37,0,'Object identified: Val\'anyr, hammer of ancient kings.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34062,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,38,0,'Created by the titans themselves, Val\'anyr was given to the first earthen king, Urel Stoneheart. With the hammer he was to create and give life to the rest of his brethren.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34063,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,39,0,'Val\'anyr was shattered during the first war between the earthen and the iron dwarves. The weapon\'s remnants were believed lost in the conflict.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34064,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,40,0,'Probability of successful repair by ordinary means available in this world is close to nil. Please hold while theoretical means are analyzed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34065,0,'Archivum System'),(33874,41,0,'Powerful acidic content theoretically found inside the being known as Yogg-Saron would account for the liquification of saronite. Submersion in this substance might be sufficient to rebind an alloy of titan origin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34066,0,'Archivum System'),(34295,0,0,'I am free of the bonds of the earth never to return again!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34507,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,1,'Like moths to the flame!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34509,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,2,'Scorch the ground, boil the water, and ignite the skies!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34504,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,3,'There is no escape! There is only the fiery embrace of my lava!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34502,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,4,'Death rises from below and erupts from above! There is no escape!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34503,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,5,'The Earthen Ring cannot withstand my fury!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34505,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,6,'Destroy them my minions!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34506,0,'say Text'),(34295,0,7,'ASHENVALE WILL BURN!',14,0,50,0,0,0,0,34508,0,'say Text'),(34365,0,2,'Children, please behave yourselves! No one will want to adopt you if you keep acting like that!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,34715,0,'Orphan Matron Aria'),(34489,1,0,'Wanna see what I can do?',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34617,0,''),(34489,2,0,'Now dance together!',12,0,0,0,0,0,0,34619,0,''),(34545,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34660,0,0,'%s\'s spikes pursue $n!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35676,0,'Anub\'arak - Spike target'),(34756,0,0,'Shh! Someone\'s here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35023,0,'Moriana Dawnlight'),(34757,0,0,'Don\'t get me wrong... I\'m grateful to have Shando Stormrage back, but this is all really suspicious. What happened to Fandral?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35024,0,'Doranel Amberleaf'),(34931,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34934,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34937,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34939,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34941,0,0,'%s goes into a frenzy!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,2384,0,'combat Frenzy'),(34942,0,0,'%s begins to invoke the Waking Nightmare!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35491,0,'Memory of Hogger - EMOTE_WAKING_NIGHTMARE'),(34960,0,0,'All aboard the gunship! Man the guns!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35228,0,'Alliance Gunship Captain'),(35033,0,0,'%s begins to invoke the Waking Nightmare!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35491,0,'Memory of Chromaggus - EMOTE_WAKING_NIGHTMARE'),(35127,0,0,'Gladly.',12,0,1,0,0,0,0,35360,0,'Cult Assassin'),(35190,0,0,'Defend the gates!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35437,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35190,0,1,'For the Horde!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,4921,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35190,0,2,'For the Warchief!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,2104,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35190,1,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(35198,0,0,'Why, what brings you all the way over here, young $r? Please be cautious. Our foes stream from a hole in the mountains to the east - they have done irreparable harm to this land.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,35480,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35198,1,0,'The Talrendis Ancient howls out in pain!',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,35470,0,'in Battle Text'),(35200,0,0,'We be here courtesy o\' the trade prince.',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35450,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35200,0,1,'Let\'s have a dance!',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35449,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35200,0,2,'Who be in charge here?',12,0,50,0,0,0,0,35454,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35503,0,0,'These grounds ... are not ... yours ...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,35859,0,'on Aggro Text'),(35845,1,0,'The Alliance now controls the Twilight Shores beach head.',41,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dave\'s Industrial Light and Magic Bunny (Small)(Sessile) to Player'),(35905,0,0,'Rescue Krennan Aranas by using your vehicle\'s ability.$B|TInterface\\Icons\\inv_misc_groupneedmore.blp:64|t',42,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'King Greymane\'s Horse to Player'),(36013,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,10677,0,'combat Enrage'),(36213,0,0,'Shut your face, you gibbering idiot!',12,1,100,0,0,0,0,36306,0,'Kor\'kron Overseer'),(36272,0,0,'Great. We\'re not gutless, we\'re incompetent.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38596,3,'SAY_FRYE_DEATH'),(36287,0,0,'You are scary!  I just want my mommy!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cynthia to Player'),(36288,0,0,'Are you one of the good worgen, $g mister:ma\'am;?  Did you see Cynthia hiding in the sheds outside?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ashley to Player'),(36289,0,0,'Don\'t hurt me!  I was just looking for my sisters!  I think Ashley\'s inside that house!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'James to Player'),(36712,0,0,'Squealer take this land! Tauren will burn!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,38323,0,'on Aggro Text'),(36856,0,0,'You\'re in luck. I\'ve got just what you need in the load I\'m about to wash.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36761,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,1,0,'See the piles of laundry and the bucket of water? I\'ll run out what I need next, and you put it in the tub. Ready?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36762,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,2,0,'Quick, add some shirts to the laundry!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36788,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,3,0,'Add the unmentionables... uh, I mean, the \'delicates\'!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,36789,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,4,0,'The tub needs more water!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,36790,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,5,0,'Toss some pants in to the tub!',12,0,100,25,0,0,0,36787,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,0,'I should keep you around.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,37989,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,1,'Well done!',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,36764,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,2,'That\'s how it\'s done!',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,37986,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,3,'Clean and tidy!',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,37985,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,4,'Nice. I don\'t want to know what that stain was.',12,0,17,0,0,0,0,37987,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,6,5,'Aquanos can hardly keep up!',12,0,15,0,0,0,0,37988,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,7,0,'Oh, no! That wasn\'t right. Now I\'ll have to go get more detergent so we can start over!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36763,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,8,0,'Aquanos, stop sending the clothes so high! You didn\'t have to see the look on Aethas Sunreaver\'s face when he found his pants in the fountain!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36817,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(36856,9,0,'See how easy that was with everyone working together? Just take what you need from the clean laundry here, but don\'t forget to return it when you\'re finished.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36791,0,'Shandy Glossgleam'),(37073,0,0,'You break our cave, I break your skull!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36904,0,'Rockjaw Goon'),(37073,0,1,'Why you break our home?!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36903,0,'Rockjaw Goon'),(37073,0,2,'Trogg cave all gone!  You pay for this!!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,36905,0,'Rockjaw Goon'),(37080,0,0,'Thanks!  I can make it from here.',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36982,0,'Wounded Coldridge Mountaineer'),(37080,0,1,'Yer a lifesaver!  For Ironforge!',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,36983,0,'Wounded Coldridge Mountaineer'),(37080,0,2,'Ahh, much better