',12,0,100,1,0,0,0,4987,0,'Hammered Patron to Mistress Nagmara'),(150237,0,0,'The geolord demands your demise!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176076,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,1,'The ogres give us strength!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176074,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,2,'Your blood will earn our reward!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176075,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,3,'We serve the geolord!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176077,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,4,'Witness our power!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176078,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,5,'Death to the outsiders!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176079,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,6,'Our thorns will strangle you!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176080,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,0,7,'More sacrifices for the ritual!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176082,0,'Quilboar Warrior aggro'),(150237,1,0,'I return... to... the earth...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176083,0,'Quilboar Warrior death'),(150237,1,1,'Our tribe... will... survive...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176084,0,'Quilboar Warrior death'),(150237,1,2,'Ogres... will... kill you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176085,0,'Quilboar Warrior death'),(150237,1,3,'The geolord... will not... lose...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176086,0,'Quilboar Warrior death'),(150237,1,4,'Thorns... take... you...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,176088,0,'Quilboar Warrior death'),(246143,0,0,'No! No, no, no! This can\'t be. I\'d rather be dead than Forsaken!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frightened Paladin - refuses'),(246143,1,0,'%s raises her weapon, preparing to attack!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frightened Paladin - attacks'),(250282,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vile Fin Seer (sniff)'),(250283,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vile Fin Attacker (sniff)'),(250656,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fallen Berserker (sniff)'),(250657,0,0,'Such errant and unfortunate souls...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rath\'mael (sniff)'),(250657,1,0,'Even in death... I will persist.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rath\'mael (sniff)'),(250660,0,0,'Fresh meat for the block!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Baron (sniff)'),(250660,1,0,'Forgive me, Lordaeron...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Baron (sniff)'),(250874,0,0,'%s becomes enraged!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vuldren Alpha (sniff)'),(250921,0,0,'The tiny sprite squeaks fearfully and vanishes!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forest Sprite (sniff)'),(250929,0,0,'THREAT DETECTED. ADMINISTERING VIOLENCE.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct (sniff)'),(250929,1,0,'FUNCTION FULFILLED. RESUMING REST MODE.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malfunctioning Cyclone Construct (sniff)'),(251451,0,0,'Die, non-believer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),(251451,1,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),(251451,2,0,'Submit to the will of the windlord and beg his forgiveness!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Ambusher (sniff)'),(251918,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highlands Bandit (sniff)'),(251966,0,0,'Only the righteous will be saved from what is to come! Death to non-believers!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Cyclas (sniff)'),(252068,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Stormcaller (sniff)'),(252383,0,0,'With the cult running roughshod over most of the island with impunity, Lorthuna undoubtedly thinks we are on the back foot. We can use that overconfidence against her.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,1,0,'I believe that with a proper distraction at the shrine, a small force of Peacekeepers, Windshapers, and High Order should be able to push up a flank and break into the inner sanctum. From there, we take out the High Priestess herself and cut the head off the snake.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,2,0,'Go and speak with the leaders of the Windshapers and the High Order, respectively. They don\'t get along, but I think they can recognize that the bigger threat is the Al\'Aketh. Get them to agree to the plan and then return here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,3,0,'...a recall crystal! Used to record an important moment, no doubt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,4,0,'The recall crystal is badly damaged, though. The recording is likely to be incomplete, so we must listen carefully.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,5,0,'The crystal is too damaged to play any further, I am afraid.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252383,6,0,'The anchor pylons keep us suspended in this realm, but they also act as wards! The Shal\'nan once spoke of this. They keep us shielded from...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist'),(252476,0,0,'Wait, yes... this crystal! Valennia, is this...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaanis Shadowsong'),(252476,1,0,'This is surely what the turncoat hoped to offer us in exchange for our protection.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaanis Shadowsong'),(252476,2,0,'Activate it, Valennia. We need to learn as much as we can about what it contains.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaanis Shadowsong'),(252476,3,0,'Wards... what is this about wards, Valennia?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaanis Shadowsong'),(252476,4,0,'...whatever else is out there in Skywall. Spirits save us... this is her plan. Bring down the wards and let her \'Windlord\' in!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Talaanis Shadowsong'),(252481,0,0,'The tiny sprite squeaks fearfully and vanishes!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wind Sprite (sniff)'),(252664,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Stormchaser (sniff)'),(252666,0,0,'Prepare to be BROKEN, non-believer!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Belguilos (sniff)'),(252763,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Spiritcaller (sniff)'),(252764,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Skypriest (sniff)'),(252800,0,0,'It\'s time, stranger. One way or another, let\'s finish this.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aamelia Windfield (sniff)'),(252802,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hungry Bandit (sniff)'),(252820,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bandit Highwayman (sniff)'),(252863,0,0,'Little apple farmers! Ferauu is here to collect what is owed!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ferauu the Bludgeon (sniff)'),(252957,0,0,'Ayessa... my former sister. How far you\'ve fallen, keeping company with this High Order filth.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(252957,1,0,'Bring the wards down? The wards have been down for days, fools. No, I am merely lighting a beacon... for the true servants of Al\'Akir to follow.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(252957,2,0,'Empty threats, Elaadrin. Regardless of what happens to me now, my great work is done. Consider yourself lucky to be here at the eye of the storm, to witness the fruits of our labor.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(252957,3,0,'Ahh... yes! The call has been answered. Meet your end with joy!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(252957,4,0,'Yes! Yes! It is by my will that the way to Zephras is open to you! Bring me before your Windlord so that he may know who was the herald of his glory!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(252957,5,0,'No! Never, I would never dare!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (spire)'),(253195,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Preacher (sniff)'),(253511,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Pillager (sniff)'),(253622,0,0,'You are too late. The ritual is complete!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander Haalien (sniff)'),(253782,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Attacker (sniff)'),(253812,0,0,'We came as soon as we were told what was happening. The High Order is here to serve Zephras.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (muster)'),(253812,1,0,'It\'s... coming from a little further away than that. We\'ll explain on the way.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (muster)'),(253813,0,0,'...and the Windshapers. We are ready to support an assault on the Shrine, Valennia.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ayessa Dawnsinger (muster)'),(253813,1,0,'We understand. As it happens Elaadrin and I spoke. We made arrangements to send for... outside aid. It\'s unclear if they will be able to arrive in time to help, or if they will even arrive at all...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ayessa Dawnsinger (muster)'),(253844,0,0,'You have my thanks. Being truthful, however, this is going to be a dangerous gambit and we may not succeed. It\'s important you understand that this might be a one-way ride.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist (muster)'),(253844,1,0,'Outside... of Zephras? From the other provinces? We haven\'t had contact with the other islands for years...?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist (muster)'),(253844,2,0,'Very well then. Time is not with us so we should make ourselves ready. Thank you all for your aid. Zephras is in your debt.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valennia Stormfist (muster)'),(253847,0,0,'I\'ll make this easy for you, witch. Stop what you are doing now and I will make your death swift. This is the last and best offer you will get from the High Order.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (spire)'),(253847,1,0,'Ansirem! This isn\'t how I expected our first meeting to go, but I\'m glad you made it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (spire)'),(253847,2,0,'Yes, and you, Archmage Runeweaver. The High Order is eager to learn more of the Kirin Tor.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elaadrin Evengale (spire)'),(253849,0,0,'Lorthuna! Stop this madness. You don\'t know what bringing down the wards protecting Zephras will do. You could doom us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ayessa Dawnsinger (spire)'),(253849,1,0,'Nor is this how I envisioned our first meeting, Muln.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ayessa Dawnsinger (spire)'),(253849,2,0,'Muln Earthfury of the Earthen Ring--the Windshapers would be happy to accept you as our guest.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ayessa Dawnsinger (spire)'),(254588,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windsong Crawler (sniff)'),(254596,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Healer (sniff)'),(255534,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Badwind\" Bennic (sniff)'),(255833,0,0,'Who dares call the Lord of the East Wind?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,1,0,'Wait... what is this place? How could such a place exist in the Windlord\'s realm?',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,2,0,'So the rumors were true. My wayward brothers did well to conceal this place from the gaze of Al\'Akir.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,3,0,'You dare to command me, mortal? No, I think not. Begone, insignificant elf!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,4,0,'Well, you certainly never will again, insect. Hah!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,5,0,'Enjoy your remaining time as \"guests\" in my lord\'s realm until his judgement inevitably arrives. You\'ll know not when, but it is coming.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,6,0,'Now that this wondrous realm is no longer hidden from us, you are going to enjoy getting to know the TRUE children of Skywall...',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,7,0,'Well if this isn\'t an inspirational sight. The little elves seem to have friends in... low places.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(255833,8,0,'Very well, mortals. For now enjoy your respite. I simply cannot wait to tell the Windlord about all that has transpired here. You will be seeing me again... very soon.',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rohash'),(256247,0,0,'No, no! Lorthuna, you do not understand. This windshaper is merely passing by. They did not come here with me!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Belathaan Brightwish - A Firm Response'),(256247,1,0,'Lorthuna, be reasonable. Elaadrin sent me to discuss a path to peace and...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Belathaan Brightwish - A Firm Response'),(256249,0,0,'It matters not. I think that I\'ll just have my pets kill the both of you and send your tongue back to Elaadrin as a warning to keep his little mages in Valanaar, where they belong.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna - A Firm Response'),(256249,1,0,'Enough. Goodbye, Belathaan and... whomever you are.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna - A Firm Response'),(256306,0,0,'The skycutter to Zephras Isle has just arrived. Please watch your step when boarding the vessel.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Arcanist Laurain (sniff)'),(256306,1,0,'The ride can sometimes be bumpy and it is recommended that you hold onto something firmly when traveling between planes of existence.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Arcanist Laurain (sniff)'),(256620,0,0,'Sorry that we are late, Ayessa.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muln Earthfury'),(256620,1,0,'We have no quarrel with you, Lord of the East Wind. Leave us in peace.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Muln Earthfury'),(256621,0,0,'It took a bit of work to convince Archmage Rhonin to help me open that transplanar portal...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver'),(256621,1,0,'I think it\'s time for us to be leaving this place. I will open a portal to Valanaar.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Ansirem Runeweaver'),(256966,0,0,'The grand design of the High Priestess is in motion! There is nothing you can do to stop it!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skypriest Aanders (sniff)'),(256966,1,0,'You cannot stop Lorthuna\'s great work! The windlord\'s will has been done!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skypriest Aanders (sniff)'),(257521,0,0,'We are the descendants of the Highborne and we will not be denied!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,1,0,'Why...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,2,0,'You will not stand in the way of progress!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,3,0,'You would doom us all...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,4,0,'Your stubborness will doom Zephras!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,5,0,'For the High Order!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257521,6,0,'Supreme Magister... I have... failed.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Apprentice (sniff)'),(257532,0,0,'Your recklessness will doom us all!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,1,0,'Spirits of the wind... forgive me...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,2,0,'Only the Windshapers can save Zephras Isle!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,3,0,'Doomed... we are... doomed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,4,0,'I have... failed...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,5,0,'Be gone from this place!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,6,0,'The meddling of your order will hasten our doom!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,7,0,'Death to the High Order desecrators!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,8,0,'You hasten our... destruction...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(257532,9,0,'The arcane is an affront to the wind spirits!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshaper Novice Seer (sniff)'),(259377,0,0,'I need no help from the light. Begone, paladin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Deathguard - healed'),(259377,0,1,'I... thank you, paladin.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Injured Deathguard - healed'),(259433,0,0,'I will not accept this! I serve the light!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Zealot (sniff)'),(259433,1,0,'The light will purify us both!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Zealot (sniff)'),(259434,0,0,'The light will purify us both!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Drudge (sniff)'),(259434,1,0,'Burn in righteous flame, vile monster!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Tarnished Drudge (sniff)'),(261306,0,0,'Defilers! Miscreants! Leave this place!',14,0,100,0,0,340212,0,0,0,'Faldrim Anvilmar - aggro (sniff; official broadcast text 310791)'),(261306,1,0,'I return... to my... rest.',14,0,100,0,0,340226,0,0,0,'Faldrim Anvilmar - death (sniff; official broadcast text 310794)'),(261311,0,0,'Loot acquisition protocol engaged.',14,0,100,0,0,340209,0,0,0,'Plunder - aggro (sniff; official broadcast text 310793)'),(261316,0,0,'Flame consumes all!',14,0,100,0,0,340200,0,0,0,'Magmatus - aggro (sniff; official broadcast text 310795)'),(261319,0,0,'Ye think you can stop the greatest heist in history?',14,0,100,0,0,340210,0,0,0,'Durgen Dirgehammer - aggro (sniff; official broadcast text 310796)'),(261319,1,0,'I nearly... got away... with it.',14,0,100,0,0,340215,0,0,0,'Durgen Dirgehammer - death (sniff; official broadcast text 310797)'),(264712,0,0,'...do not delay. Muster our forces to march immediately. The pylons are key and...the wards...come down. This is...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (recall crystal)'),(264712,1,0,'...quickly. With our forces.....will be exposed.....my ritual must not....',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (recall crystal)'),(264712,2,0,'I alone am.....this task....the Windlord will.......our voices.....he will come.....we must not fail!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Priestess Lorthuna (recall crystal)'),(265701,0,0,'Engoth Nagan waldir! Far Gothalgos!',12,7,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Captain Truman (sniff)'),(270201,0,0,'%s attempts to run away in fear!',16,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Al\'Aketh Brawler (sniff)'),(271613,0,0,'UUUUUuuuuurrrgh!!',14,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unfinished Abomination (sniff)'),(271968,0,0,'I was in over my head!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer - freed'),(271968,0,1,'It had to be spiders...',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer - freed'),(271968,0,2,'Has anyone seen my weapon?',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer - freed'),(271968,0,3,'Thank you. I\'ll head back to Deathknell.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Forsaken Adventurer - freed'),(272101,0,0,'I will double up my efforts.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deathguard Lizabetha (sniff)'),(275269,0,0,'The skycutter bound for Dalaran City has just arrived. All aboard for Dalaran City!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'High Order Dockmaster (sniff)'),(275270,0,0,'The Skycutter bound for Mulgore has arrived! All aboard for Mulgore!',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Windshapers Dockmaster (sniff)'),(275954,0,0,'The heretics were to try me for my crimes--of existing at all, I suppose.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),(275954,1,0,'I believe I\'ve overstayed my welcome. Let\'s get out of here.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),(275954,2,0,'Follow that path up into Bandarion Keep, if you wish. Others like myself are stationed there.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),(275954,3,0,'Brill is this way. Let\'s keep moving.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)'),(275954,4,0,'I can make it the rest of the way on my own. Let Shari Stilwell know I\'m safe. I have one small matter to attend to first.',12,0,100,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bareth Dawnstone (sniff)');
